[prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

devadeva jagannātha sarvajña karuṇānidhe |
prasannāt tatrabhavato dharmā nānāvidhāḥ śrutāḥ |
vihitāḥ pūrvaśaivānāṃ saṃmatāḥ śrutisaṃtateḥ || 1 ||

bhavatā hi purā proktaṃ karuṇāyantritātmanā |
vīraśaivīyadharmāstu sarvadharmottamā iti |
tānadya śrotukāmā'smi prasanno brūhyaśeṣataḥ || 2 ||

mahādeva uvāca

sādhu pṛṣṭaṃ tvayā devi lokānugrahacittayā |
hanta te kathayiṣyāmi dharmān śāmbhavasaṃmatān |
sadyomuktipradānadya madīyajñānasādhanān || 3 ||

śāmbhavavrataparigrahaṇam

yadetacchāmbhavaṃ nāma vrataṃ śrutyantasaṃmatam |
punarbhavaprahāṇāya mumukṣustatsamācaret || 4 ||

<p. 2> brahmacārī gṛhastho vā vānaprastho yatistu vā |
yoṣidvā parigṛhṇīyāt sadyomuktiṃ yadīcchati || 5 ||

vidyate nāsya sadṛśaṃ vedeṣvanyeṣu vā kvacit |
kāṅkṣeta muktiṃ yaḥ sadyaḥ sa etadvratamācaret || 6 ||

titīrṣurjanmavārāśiṃ gurupotaṃ samāśrayet |
samyak parīkṣya vai śiṣyaṃ gṛhṇīyād deśikottamaḥ || 7 ||

nivedayiṣyanmajjñānaṃ dadyādādau śirovratam |
anyathā guruśiṣyau tau patato narakāmbudhau || 8 ||

atyāśramaṃ pāśupataṃ śāmbhavaṃ tacchirovratam |
ityevaṃ nāmabhiḥ puṇyairnigamānteṣu gīyate || 9 ||

dīkṣātrayanirdeśaḥ

tanutrayagatānādimalatrayamasau guruḥ |
dīkṣātrayeṇa saṃdahya liṅgatrayamupādiśet || 10 ||

<p. 3> svāgre sthitasya śiṣyasya deśikaḥ karuṇānidhiḥ |
kuryād dīkṣāṃ mahāśaivīmavidyāpāśakṛntinīm || 11 ||

dīyate liṅgasambandhaḥ kṣīyate ca malatrayam |
dīyate kṣīyate yasmāt sā dīkṣeti nigadyate || 12 ||

sā dīkṣā paramā śaivī tridhā bhavati nirmalā |
ekā vedhātmikā sākṣādanyā mantrātmikā matā |
kriyātmikā parā kācidevameva tridhā bhavet || 13 ||

hastamastakasaṃyogād duṣṭervedheti kīryate |
guruṇodīritā karṇe sā hi mantrātmikā bhavet |
śiṣyapāṇitale dattā yā dīkṣā sā kriyā bhavet || 14 ||

atraikaikāpi vikhyātā dīkṣāsaptakaśobhitā |
tatprakāraṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇuṣvaikāgramānasā || 15 ||

<p. 4> maṇḍapanirmāṇavidhiḥ

dīkṣayiṣyannihācāryaḥ śiṣyaṃ pūrvoktalakṣaṇam |
yuktakāle tadaṅgāni dravyāṇyāhṛtya yatnataḥ |
maṇḍapaṃ kārayet samyagvakṣye tallakṣaṇaṃ yathā || 16 ||

daśabhiḥ sūryahastairvā manubhirnṛpahastakaiḥ |
dīkṣārthaṃ maṇḍapaṃ kuryāt ṣoḍaśastambhasaṃyutam || 17 ||

eteṣāṃ maṇḍapānāṃ ca pañcahastonnatiṃ viduḥ |
caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ catustoraṇabhūṣitam || 18 ||

nyagrodhastasya pūrvasyāṃ dakṣiṇasyāmudumbaraḥ |
aśvattha uttarasyāṃ ca plakṣaḥ paścimato bhavet || 19 ||

navabhāgaikabhāge tu madhye vedīṃ prakalpayet |
hastamātrasamutsedhāṃ darpaṇodarasannibhām || 20 ||

kuṇḍāni kalpayettatra nava pañcaikameva vā |
pūrvasmiṃścaturaśraṃ syādvahnau pippalapatravat || 21 ||

ardhacandraṃ tu yāmye syānnairṛtyāṃ tu trikoṇakam |
vṛttaṃ syādvāraṇe bhāge vāyavye tu ṣaḍaśrakam || 22 ||

padmaṃ syāduttare bhāge caiśānyāmaṣṭakoṇakam |
syādīśānendrayormadhye vṛttaṃ vā caturaśrakam || 23 ||

indrādisomakāṣṭhāntamaiśānyāṃ ca prakalpayet |
caturaśrārdhacandre ca vṛttaṃ padmaṃ ca vartulam || 24 ||

ekāgnivedikā pūrve cottare paścime'pi vā |
īśānyāṃ caturaśraṃ vā vṛttaṃ vā'pi prakalpayet || 25 ||

sthaṇḍilaṃ vā'tha kurvīta hastamātrapramāṇakam |
sikatābhirmṛdā vā'pi guṇāṅgulamitonnatim |
maṇḍapaṃ racayitvaivaṃ dhvajādyaistaṃ vibhūṣayet || 26 ||

muktājālavitānaiśca phalapallavapaṅkajaiḥ |
rambhābhirdarbhamālābhirdarpaṇairdhūpavartibhiḥ || 27 ||

tatra gaurīlatāliṅgamaṇḍalaṃ vilikhed budhaḥ |
pañcavarṇayutaiścūrṇairathavā śubhravarṇakaiḥ || 28 ||

dīkṣāvidhānam

snātaḥ sabhasmarudrākṣaḥ sakalīkṛtavigrahaḥ |
gururmāheśvaraiḥ sārdhaṃ prāpya maṇḍapamasya tu || 29 ||

<p. 6> dvārāṇyastreṇa samprokṣya tāni catvāri cārcayet |
oṃ hāṁ śāntikalābhikhyadvārāya nama ityapi |
oṃ hāṁ vidyākalābhikhyadvārāya nama ityapi || 30 ||

hāṁ nivṛttikalābhikhyadvārāya nama ityapi |
hāṁ pratiṣṭhākalābhikhyadvārāya nama ityapi |
pūrvādīni samabhyarcya tatastacchākhayornyaset || 31 ||

nandinaṃ ca mahākālaṃ bhṛṅgiṇaṃ ca vināyakam |
vṛṣaṃ skandaṃ tathā devaṃ caṇḍaṃ dvau dvau caturṣvapi || 32 ||

tālatritayamastreṇa kṛtvā vāmāṅghripārṣṇitaḥ |
ghātratrayaṃ tathā kṛtvā vighnānutsārya yatnataḥ || 33 ||

dvārāṇyastreṇa tūdghāṭya pratīcīdvārato budhaḥ |
antaḥ praviśya yāgopakaraṇānyavalokya ca || 34 ||

astraprākārāvṛtaśca kavacenāvaguṇṭhitaḥ |
sukhāsane tūpaviśet kuśādiparikalpite || 35 ||

tataḥ sa śiṣyastāmbūladakṣiṇābhasmasaṃyutam |
pātraṃ gṛhītvā prabrūyādevaṃ sadgurusannidhau || 36 ||

<p. 7> saṃsārāmbudhinirmagnaṃ janmagrāhabhayākulam |
mṛtyupāśavaśaṃ dīnaṃ kṛpayā'nugṛhāṇa mām |
iti vijñāpya tatpātraṃ saṃsthāpyāgre'bhivādayet || 37 ||

gurustatpātramānīya nikṣipya gaṇamadhyake |
parigṛhya gaṇānujñāmupaviśyāsane punaḥ || 38 ||

dīkṣayiṣyannihācāryo deśakālau nigadya ca |
gaṇeśapūjanaṃ kuryāt svastipuṇyāhavācanam || 39 ||

punargaṇānnamaskṛtya deśakālau prakīrtya ca |
dehatrayagatānādimalatrayanivṛttaye || 40 ||

liṅgatrayānusaṃdhānayogyatāvāptaye'pi ca |
ṣaḍadhvaśuddhipūrveṇa śāmbhavena vratena || 41 ||

saptavidhā dīkṣā

dīkṣayiṣya imaṃ śiṣyaṃ śaktipātavidhānataḥ |
iti saṃkalpya dadyācca sapta dīkṣāḥ kriyāntarāḥ || 42 ||

ājñopamā ca kaśābhiṣekākhyā tataḥ param |
svastikārohaṇaṃ bhūtipaṭṭamāyattameva ca |
svāyattamiti saptaitāḥ kriyādīkṣāntarā matāḥ || 43 ||

<p. 8> parityajya sadācāraṃ mā pravartasva sarvadā |
ityājñādīkṣayā'diśya tatastvevaṃ vaded guruḥ || 44 ||

purātanakṛtācārasadṛśaṃ kurviti sphuṭam |
upamādīkṣayā'diśya śiṣyapāpāpanuttaye |
prāṇānāyamya vidhivat pañcagavyāni sādhayet || 45 ||

śrīpañcakalaśārthaṃ tu ṛtviji vṛṇuyād guruḥ |
caturṇāṃ caturācāryā madhyasya ca svayaṃ bhavet || 46 ||

āvāhayecca kalaśe madhye tvīśānamagrataḥ |
sadyojātaṃ ca pūrvasmin vāmadevaṃ tu dakṣiṇe || 47 ||

uttare tatpuruṣaṃ ca aghoraṃ cātha paścime |
tattanmantraiḥ samāvāhya pūjayettadanantaram || 48 ||

<p. 9> jalādhivāsanam

maṇḍapottaradigbhāge maṇḍalaṃ parikalpya tu |
śivaliṅgaṃ samuddhṛtya pañcasūtropalakṣitam || 49 ||

tāmrapātre vinikṣipya deśakālau prakīrtya ca |
gharṣaṇādikriyājātajātadoṣopaśāntaye || 50 ||

hiraṇyaśṛṅgapramukhairanuvākairanukramāt |
śivaliṅgaṃ snāpayāmītyabhiṣiñcedanantaram || 51 ||

pañcagavyena siddhena śuddhaiḥ pañcāmṛtairapi |
abhiṣiñcediṣṭaliṅgaṃ pañcabrahmamanūttamaiḥ || 52 ||

<p. 10> śuddhodakena talliṅgaṃ punaḥ saṃsnāpya deśikaḥ |
pātrāntare vinikṣipya nairṛte padmamaṇḍale |
nikṣipya gandhapuṣpādyairarcayed deśikottamaḥ || 53 ||

tataḥ śāṇādisaṃgharṣajātatāpopaśāntaye |
vāruṇe maṇḍale prasthamitapānīyapūrite || 54 ||

tāmrapātre tu nikṣipya talliṅgaṃ vastraveṣṭitam |
jalādhivāsanaṃ kuryādabliṅgairmanubhistataḥ || 55 ||

jalāduttārya talliṅgaṃ snānapātre nidhāya vai |
tatpātraṃ tu vinikṣipya maṇḍale vāyukoṇage || 56 ||

pañcagavyena ca tathā bhasmanā gandhavāribhiḥ |
taduktamantraiḥ saṃsnāpya liṅgamudvartya vāsasā || 57 ||

pātrāntare vinikṣipya tatpātraṃ somamaṇḍale |
nidhāya gandhapuṣpādyairarcayed deśikastataḥ || 58 ||

dhānyādhivāsanam

saptadhātusphūrtaye tu kuryāddhānyāvidhivāsanam |
tadvidhānaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu devi samāsataḥ || 59 ||

<p. 11> dakṣiṇe maṇḍale prasthapramitaiḥ śālibhiḥ kramāt |
tadardhaistaṇḍulaiścaiva tadardhaiśca tilaistathā || 60 ||

uparyupari vinyasya sthaṇḍilāni prayatnataḥ |
darbhairācchādya talliṅgaṃ prākchiraskamadhomukham || 61 ||

tatra nikṣipya gandhādīn darbhāṃstatpuruṣeṇa tu |
liṅge nikṣipya tasyāṣṭadikṣukumbhān vinikṣipet || 62 ||

aṣṭavidyeśvarāṃsteṣu cāvāhya paripūjya ca |
vastrairācchādya kurvīta śivāgnimukhamapyatha || 63 ||

śayanālliṅgamuddhṛtya vahnidiggatamaṇḍale |
saṃsthāpya rudrasūktena saṃsnāpya tadanantaram |
maṇḍale pūrvadiksaṃsthe nikṣipya ca samarcayet || 64 ||

punastalliṅgamādāya maṇḍale tvīśakoṇage |
pātrāntare vinikṣipya pañcarudraistu snāpayet |
dhānyādhivāsakalitamaṇḍalīkalaśodakaiḥ || 65 ||

<p. 12> adhvanyāsādividhiḥ

tataḥ śivakalāvāhanārthaṃ kuryād yathāvidhi |
adhvanyāsān ṣaḍapyatra liṅge saṃkalpyapūrvakam || 66 ||

bhuvanābhikhyamadhvānaṃ paṭṭikāyāmadho nyaset |
tatkañje tu padādhvānaṃ varṇādhvānaṃ ca madhyake || 67 ||

ūrdhvakañje kalādhvānaṃ paṭṭikāyāṃ tathā punaḥ |
tattvādhvānaṃ ca vinyasyettata ājyapraghārike |
mantrādhvānaṃ ca vinyasya gandhādyairabhipūjayet || 68 ||

agnyādisthāpanam

tatkalāsthairyasiddhyarthaṃ homaṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
caturviṃśatyuttaratriśatasaṃkhyāyutena ca |
pañcākṣareṇa manunā satāreṇa tathā punaḥ || 69 ||

pradhānakuṇḍe juhuyād vyāhṛtībhirghṛtena tu |
jayādibhiśca juhuyādagniṃ rakṣedanantaram || 70 ||

śiṣyaṃ samāhvayan saumyaṃ saumyātropaviśeti ca |
kūrmāsanoparigate kuśādiparikalpite || 71 ||

<p. 13> āsane samupāveśya pañcabrahmamanūttamaiḥ |
karanyāsaṃ vidhāyādau prāṇasandhāraṇādibhiḥ |
viśodhya dehaṃ tadanu vidadhyād bhūtaśodhanam || 72 ||

sakalīkaraṇaṃ kuryācchiṣyadehasya deśikaḥ |
pañcagavyena tasyātha kuryādantarviśodhanam || 73 ||

atha śiṣyasyābhiṣekadīkṣāṃ dadyād gurūttamaḥ |
anādibhavasaṃpannasarvadoṣopaśāntaye || 74 ||

pañcakumbhodakaiḥ śuddhaiḥ śiṣyaṃ saṃsnāpayedapi |
pañcatattvaviśuddhyarthaṃ pañcabrahmamanūn japan || 75 ||

pañcakumbheṣu ghaṭitaṃ sūtramuddhṛtya deśikaḥ |
viśvettāteti taddhaste badhnīyāt kaṅkaṇaṃ tataḥ || 76 ||

ṣaḍadhvaśodhanam

ṣaḍadhvaśodhanadvārā māṃsapiṇḍanivṛttaye |
svastikārohaṇābhikhyāṃ dīkṣāṃ dadyādyathāvidhi || 77 ||

saṃhārakramato vidvān śabdārthātmaṣaḍadhvanaḥ |
pādādiṣu tu vinyasyecchiṣyasya niyatātmanaḥ || 78 ||

<p. 14> varṇādhvānaṃ śabdarūpaṃ vinyasyet pādayorbudhaḥ |
artharūpaṃ kalādhvānaṃ meḍhre nyasyedanantaram || 79 ||

śabdarūpaṃ padādhvānaṃ nābhau vinyasya deśikaḥ |
tattvādhvānaṃ tvartharūpaṃ hṛdi nyasyedatandritaḥ || 80 ||

mantrādhvānaṃ śabdarūpaṃ vinyasyaivaṃ mukhe tathā |
artharūpaṃ ca bhuvanādhvānaṃ nyasyecchirasyapi || 81 ||

pādādiṣu śikhānteṣu ṣaṭsu sthāneṣu saṃyataḥ |
ṣaḍakṣarāṇi vinyasya ṣaḍvāraṃ deśikastataḥ || 82 ||

bhūtirudrākṣadhāraṇam

anādimalasaṃhṛtyai bhūtipaṭṭākhyadīkṣayā |
snānamuddhūlanaṃ bhūtyā dhāraṇaṃ cāpi kārayet |
tataḥ śikhādisthāneṣu rudrākṣān dhārayet kramāt || 83 ||

rudrākṣamekaṃ saṃmantrya sampūjya ca yathāvidhi |
śiṣyasya dakṣiṇe haste badhnīyād bandhamuktaye || 84 ||

śiṣyasya dehasthāṇavādimalatrayanivṛttaye |
caturviṃśatyuttaratriśatasaṃkhyā yutena tu |
pañcākṣareṇa juhuyāt satāreṇa ghṛtena vai || 85 ||

<p. 15> hutvā vyāhṛtibhiścaiva jayādibhirapi kramāt |
pūrṇāhutiṃ vidhāyāgniṃ śiṣyahṛtsarasīruhe |
saṃhāramudrayā'ropya pidadhyānmaṇḍaladvayam || 86 ||

rudrādikṣetrapālāntaṃ baliṃ tatpūrvamaṇḍale |
dvitīye ca mahendrādimaheśāntaṃ baliṃ kṣipet |
anantaraṃ gururdadyād dīkṣāmāyatttasaṃjñitām || 87 ||

āyattadīkṣā svāyattadīkṣā ca

madhyamaṇḍalanikṣiptaṃ sūtrapañcakalakṣitam |
śānteśvarābhidhaṃ sarvamantranyāsopaśobhitam || 88 ||

iṣṭaliṅgaṃ samādāya vāmahaste'bhipūjya ca |
saumyaitalliṅgamīkṣasvetīṣṭaliṅgaṃ pradarśayet || 89 ||

gurvantevāsinormadhye grāhayitvā paṭaṃ tadā |
cūrṇikāmaṅgaladhvānaiḥ paṭheyurmaṅgalāṣṭakam || 90 ||

tato māheśvaraiḥ sārdhaṃ śiṣyamuddiśya deśikaḥ |
aṅgatraye'pi dṛḍhato liṅgavān bhava sarvadā || 91 ||

<p. 16> iti bruvan javanikāṃ varjayan śiśyamūrdhani |
dhruvaṃ ta iti mantreṇa nikṣipenmaṅgalākṣatān || 92 ||

uttarābhimukhaṃ śiṣyaṃ vāmabhāge nijāsane |
niveśayan tasya dadyād dīkṣāṃ svāyattasaṃjñitām || 93 ||

vastreṇācchādayan śiṣyamātmānaṃ ca gurustadā |
vāmahastaṃ tu śiṣyasya mūlenaivābhimantrya ca || 94 ||

saptavāraṃ susampūjya svavāmakarasaṃsthitam |
nikṣepattatra talliṅgaṃ triyambakamanuṃ smaran |
tataḥ saptāpi dadyācca dīkṣāstāḥ samayādikāḥ || 95 ||

saptavidhā dīkṣā

ādyā samayasaṃjñā syānniḥsaṃsārā dvitīyakā |
nirvāṇākhyā tṛtīyā syāt tattvasaṃjñā caturthikā || 96 ||

pañcamādhyātmasaṃjñā syāt ṣaṣṭhī tattvaviśodhinī |
saptamī tattvabodhā syād vedhādīkṣāntarā imāḥ || 97 ||

samayadīkṣā

prāṇānāyamya ca guruḥ saptemāḥ samayādikāḥ |
kariṣya iti saṅkalpya tanmūrdhānaṃ samarcya ca || 98 ||

<p. 17> ṣaḍakṣareṇa manunā hastaṃ svasya ca dakṣiṇam |
ṣaḍvāramabhimantryātha śivahastaṃ vibhāvya ca |
taṃ śiṣyaśirasi nyasya paṭhedekāgramānasaḥ || 99 ||

ayaṃ me hastaṃ ityevaṃ mantraṃ śiṣyaṃ vilokayan |
bho śiṣyeti ca sambodhya brūyādevaṃ vicakṣaṇaḥ || 100 ||

hitvā bandhujane prītiṃ tāṃ bhakteṣu sthirāṃ kuru |
evaṃ samayamādiśya niḥsaṃsārāṃ nibodhayet || 101 ||

niḥsaṃsārā dīkṣā

dehendriyādisaṃsāraṃ parihṛtya sadā mama |
pūjopacāraḥ saṃsāra iti bhāvaya cetasi |
ityādiśya ca dayācca dīkṣāṃ nirvāṇasaṃjñitām || 102 ||

nirvāṇadīkṣā

malatrayasamudbhūte tāpatrayabhayākule |
durante durbhavopānte mano na kuru yatnataḥ |
iti nirvāṇamādiśya dadyāt tattvābhidhāyinīm || 103 ||

<p. 18> tattvadīkṣā

liṅgāṅgatattve vijñāya liṅgasāyujyavān bhava |
upadiśyaivamatha ca dadyādadhyātmasaṃjñitām || 104 ||

adhyātmadīkṣā

prāṇe liṅgaṃ pratiṣṭhāpya liṅge prāṇaṃ nidhāya ca |
liṅgaṃ nirīkṣamāṇaḥ san liṅgaprāṇī sadā bhava |
ādiśyaivaṃ tato dadyāt tattvasaṃśodhanātmikām || 105 ||

tattvasaṃśodhanadīkṣā

śabdādīn viṣayān sarvāṃstattadindriyagocarān |
ācāraliṅgamukhyebhyaḥ ṣaḍliṅgebhyaḥ samarpayet || 106 ||

tattvabodhākhyā dīkṣā

vartasva śuddhadhīrnityaṃ prayato'pi jitendriyaḥ |
upadiśyaivamapi ca dadyāt tattvopadeśinīm |
dadyāddīkṣāṃ vidhānajñaḥ kṛpāparavaśo guruḥ || 107 ||

saccitsukhanijākāraṃ liṅgaṃ yad brahmasaṃjñitam |
tadasi tvamupāsvātastadevāhamiti dhruvam |
bodhākhyayā dīkṣayaivaṃ śiṣyamādiśya deśikaḥ || 108 ||

<p. 19> saptavidhā mantradīkṣā

prāṇānāyamya ca gururmanudīkṣācikīrṣayā |
sapta caikāgracittādyā dadyād dīkṣā anukramāt || 109 ||

tatraikāgramatistvādyā dvitīyā tu dṛḍhavratā |
pañcendriyārpaṇābhikhyā tṛtīyā parikīrtitā || 110 ||

ahiṃsākhyā turīyā syālliṅganiṣṭhā tu pañcamī |
anantarā vinirdiṣṭā ṣaṣṭhī liṅgamanolayā |
saptamī tu samākhyātā sadyomuktisamāhvayā || 111 ||

tatsvarūpaṃ pravakṣyāmi śṛṇu devi samāsataḥ |
iṣṭaliṅgāt paraṃ vastu śiṣya tvaṃ nāvalokaya |
ityekāgramatiṃ datvā dīkṣāṃ dadyād dṛḍhavratām || 112 ||

śarīrapātaparyantaṃ na jahīhi vratānyapi |
dṛḍhavratāmiti proktvā dadyāt pañcendriyārpaṇām || 113 ||

satyahaṃ matpatirliṅgamiti niścitya cetasi |
sadā tanumanobhāvāniṣṭādibhyaḥ samarpaya |
ityādiśya tato dadyādahiṃsāsaṃjñitāṃ guruḥ || 114 ||

<p. 20> sarvāṇīmāni bhūtānyapyātmavat paribhāvayan |
mā hiṃsīrityupādiśya liṅganiṣṭhāmupādiśet || 115 ||

ādimadhyāntarahitaṃ liṅgaṃ yad brahmasaṃjñitam |
tanniṣṭho bhava sadbuddha ityupādiśya sadguruḥ |
dīkṣāmupadiśed bhūyo liṅgarūpamanolayām || 116 ||

liṅgarūpamabhidhyāyannamanaskaściraṃ bhava |
ityādiśya punardadyāt sadyomuktisamāhvayām || 117 ||

mantropadeśavidhiḥ

maduktārthe sthiramatiḥ pravartasva visaṃśayaḥ |
iti sambodhya sa gururmantradvayamidaṃ paṭhet |
prāṇeṣvantariti spaṣṭaṃ śivena vacaseti ca || 118 ||

śiṣyasya dakṣiṇe karṇe ṣaḍakṣaramanuṃ śanaiḥ |
trivāramupadiśyaivaṃ bhāvitāṃ manudīkṣayā || 119 ||

śaivīṃ kalāṃ svamanasā vibhāvya ca tataḥ param |
dṛṣṭāvānīya ca tayā śiṣyavāmakarasthite |
liṅge niveśayet kṣipraṃ mūlamantramanusmaran || 120 ||

<p. 21> yathā kalā tathā bhāvo yathā bhāvastathā manaḥ |
yathā manastathā dṛṣṭiryathā dṛṣṭistathā sthalam || 121 ||

jalakumbhāgrasadvyāptatailabinduryathā tathā |
dehaprāṇātmasuvyāptā saṃsthitā śāmbhavī kalā || 122 ||

jvalatkālānalābhāsā taṭitkoṭisamaprabhā |
tasyordhve tu śikhā sūkṣmā cidrūpā paramā kalā || 123 ||

yā kalā paramā sūkṣmā tattvānāṃ bodhinī parā |
tāmākṛṣya yathānyāyaṃ liṅge samupaveśayet |
prāṇapratiṣṭhāmantraṃ ca mūlamantraṃ pathedapi || 124 ||

athāsmin saṃskṛte liṅge susthiro bhava sarvadā |
kiñca bhaktaikagātrastvaṃ bhavetyabhyarthayecca mām || 125 ||

mā bhūyā bhautikaprāṇī liṅgaprāṇī bhaveti ca |
śiṣyamādiśya dadyācca pādatīrthaprasādakau || 126 ||

<p. 22> bhūyo'pyupadiśocchiṣyaṃ sadguruḥ karuṇānidhiḥ |
māheśvarān guruṃ liṅgaṃ samyagarcaya nityaśaḥ || 127 ||

aṣṭasvāvaraṇeṣu tvaṃ śraddhāṃ kuru prayatnataḥ |
pravartasva mahābuddhe pañcācāreṣvapi kramāt || 128 ||

aṅgaliṅgapratiṣṭhādīkṣā

iti sambodhya bhūyo'pi prāṇānāyamya deśikaḥ |
aṅgaliṅgapratiṣṭhākhyāṃ dīkṣāṃ śiṣyasya dhīmataḥ || 129 ||

kariṣ.ya iti saṃkalpya liṅgaṃ baddhvā suvāsā |
namo brahmaṇa ityetaṃ dhṛtimantraṃ samuccaran || 130 ||

śiṣyasya kaṇṭhe haste vā badhnīyāt tadanantaram |
gurvantevāsinorvāsa ācchādakamanūtsṛjet || 131 ||

śiṣyakartavyanirdeśaḥ

gurave'tha sa śiṣyasu praṇāmatrayamācaret |
gobhūmyādyairmahādānairdeśikaṃ paritoṣayet || 132 ||

sadyomuktipradametad vratam

ayi proktaṃ mayā devi sadyomuktipradaṃ vratam |
śṛṇu vedeṣvananteṣu vistṛteṣvāgameṣu ca |
nātaḥ parataraṃ kiñcidvidyate mokṣasādhanam || 133 ||

śrautasmārtasadācāraparasyānantajanmasu |
cittaśuddhyā bhaved bhaktiranyadevasamāśrayā || 134 ||

anyadevārcanavyagracetaso'nantajanmasu |
devāntaraprasādena mayi bhaktiḥ prajāyate || 135 ||

madarcanaparasyāpi dehino bahujanmasu |
labhyate matprasādena kasyāpyantimajanmanaḥ || 136 ||

vratamahimā

deśikasya prasādena yena labdhamidaṃ vratam |
na taṃ māyā'nubadhnāti na sa bhūyo'bhijāyate || 137 ||

gurubodhāgninā dagdhā yasya pāśā hyaśeṣataḥ |
tasya nirdagdhabandhasya punarbandhaḥ kathaṃ bhavet || 138 ||

gurukāruṇyapīyūṣarasāsvādavinodinaḥ |
amṛtasyāsya nikaṭaṃ kathaṃ mṛtyuḥ prayāsyati || 139 ||

<p. 24> gurudattaparajñānaprakāśavilasaddṛśaḥ |
bhāsvatastasya tu tamaḥ sakāśāṃ kathameṣyati || 140 ||

anavadhyasmadānandatundilasya mahāmateḥ |
viduṣo nityatṛptasya kathaṃ śoko bhaviṣyati || 141 ||

śrutau yasya madīyoktau viśvāsaḥ paramo bhavet |
sa evātrādhikārī syānnānyo mokṣāya kalpate || 142 ||

iti devi mayāproktaṃ śāmbhavavratalakṣaṇam |
gopanīyaṃ prayatnena kimataḥ śrotumicchasi || 143 ||

[iti śrīkāraṇagame uttabhāge śrīparvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
mahāpāśupatavidhirnāma prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 1 ||




[dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

devadeva mahādeva jagadīśa namo'stu te |
etadākarṇanādasmi kṛtakṛtyā maheśvara || 1 ||

atra me jāyate kaścit saṃśayaḥ śaśiśekhara |
tadapākuru kāruṇyāt prāṇeśa śṛṇu madvacaḥ || 2 ||

jñānādeva tu kaivalyamiti proktaṃ tvayā purā |
etadvratenaiva bhavenmuktirityucyate katham || 3 ||

jñānena na vinā muktiryadi syād dehadhāriṇām |
vratenānuṣṭhitena syāt kiṃ phalaṃ brūhi tattvataḥ || 4 ||

mahādeva uvāca

jñānādeva kaivalyam

sādhu pṛṣṭaṃ devi vakṣyāmyavahitā śṛṇu |
jñānādeva tu kaivalyamiti satyaṃ vaco mama || 5 ||

<p. 26> tathā'pi jñānasamprāptirvratena na vinā bhavet |
jñānopadeśaḥ kārtsnyena vrate'sminnucyate kila |
vratenānena na vinā jñānāyādhikṛto bhavet || 6 ||

adīkṣāsaṃskṛte jantāvapavitrahṛdākule |
upadiṣṭamapi jñānaṃ maruvanna prarohati || 7 ||

labdhaṃ kathamapi jñānaṃ liṅganiṣṭhāvivarjite |
na phalāya bhavatyeva yathā sasyamarakṣitam || 8 ||

dīkṣāsaṃskṛtisaṃśuddhe citte jantoḥ samarpitam |
liṅgāṅgasāmarasyākhyaṃ manniṣṭhāgopitaṃ param |
bhaktisiktaṃ mama jñānaṃ mokṣāya bhavati dhruvam || 9 ||

matprasādena na vinā muktiḥ saṃsṛtibandhanāt |
mama jñānena na vinā matprasādo bhaviṣyati || 10 ||

dīkṣāyā jñānasādhanatvam

majjñānaṃ na bhavatyeva hyanayā dīkṣayā vinā |
tasmādīyaṃ mahādīkṣā mokṣadā niścitā khalu || 11 ||

<p. 27> tasmād dīkṣāmimāṃ muktvā mokṣakāmaḥ pathāntaraiḥ |
gacchanna muñcate jantuḥ kalpakoṭiśatairapi |
tasmādasaṃśayaṃ devi vrametad vimuktidam || 12 ||

devyuvāca

devātra mama bhūyo'pi jāyate saṃśayo mahān |
uktaṃ hi bhavatā dīkṣā jñānadvārā vimokṣadā |
tasmāt siddhā hi dīkṣāyā jñānasādhanatā param || 13 ||

vidyeta dīkṣitaḥ kaścit samyagjñānavivarjitaḥ |
rāgadveṣānubaddhaśca tasya muktiḥ kathaṃ bhavet || 14 ||

yadi tasyāpi muktiḥ syād jñānāpekṣā nirarthakā |
codvimuktirna tasya syād vratametanna mokṣadam |
tametaṃ saṃśayaṃ chindhi karuṇāvaruṇālaya || 15 ||

mahādeva uvāca

yuktaṃ pṛṣṭavatī devi tuṣṭo'smi tava bhāṣaṇāt |
rahasyaṃ kathayāmyadya tvatsaṃśayanivārakam || 16 ||

<p. 28> śāmbhavavratasya jñānasādhanatvam

ajñasya kuṭilasyāpi śāmbhavavratasevinaḥ |
prāṇotkramaṇavelāyāṃ vārāṇasyāmiva dhruvam || 17 ||

jñānamāvedayiṣyāmi matsvarūpanibodhakam |
tena vai mucyate janturmatprasādānna saṃśayaḥ || 18 ||

gṛhṇan dīkṣāmimāṃ vātha vasan vā'nandakānanam |
naro yathecchācāro'pi na bhīyānmṛtyubandhanāt || 19 ||

na janmayātanā jantorna ca saṃyamayātanā |
majjñānavimukhasyāpi śāmbhavavratasevinaḥ || 20 ||

mahāpātakayukto'pi dīkṣitaḥ śucitāmiyāt |
dīkṣitaḥ pātakī caita syād gacchedbhairavayātanām || 21 ||

sa tathā bhairavīmugrāṃ yātanāmanubhūya ca |
madanugrahapātraḥ syānnapunarjanmabhāgbhavet || 22 ||

<p. 29> dīkṣito'dīkṣito vā'pi śaivācāravidūṣakaḥ |
bhaktādinindakaścet syānnarakī kālamakṣayam || 23 ||

taduktaṃ hi mayā devi dīkṣayaṃ mokṣadetyaho |
nahyatra saṃśayaḥ kāryo maduktau girikanyake || 24 ||

devyuvāca

mamāparādhaḥ kṣantavyo mīḍhuṣṭama namo'stu te |
tvayi prasanne jagati durlabhaṃ kimu vidyate || 25 ||

na ko'pi viśayo me'sti bhavaduktau bhavodbhava |
śrutau kimasti viśayaḥ sā bhavatsūktireva hi || 26 ||

tathā'pyapṛcchaṃ lokānāṃ saṃśayāpajihīrṣayā |
saṃvṛttā gatasaṃdehā vṛṣavāha kṣamasva mām || 27 ||

mahādeva uvāca

bhavatyāḥ paripṛcchantyā janatānujighṛkṣayā |
neha doṣo'ṇurapyasti guṇa eva mahān bhavet |
paripṛcchasva kimapi vakṣyāmi girinandini || 28 ||

<p. 30> devyuvāca

seyaṃ hi śāmbhavī dīkṣā jñāniṣṭhāvidhāyinī |
dṛśyate jñānaniṣṭhā hi yaterevocitā bhavet || 29 ||

nityanaimittikamukhakarmatatparacetasaḥ |
kuṭumbabharaṇavyagramanaso gṛhamedhinaḥ |
jñānaniṣṭhā kathaṃ sadhyā brūhi me karuṇānidhe || 30 ||

mahādeva uvāca

jñānaniṣṭhāyāṃ sarveṣāmadhikāraḥ

mokṣāyādhikṛto loke yatireva kathaṃ bhavet |
brahmacārī gṛhastho vā vānaprastho yatistu vā || 31 ||

brāhmaṇaḥ kṣatriyo vā'tha vaiṣyaḥ śūdro'ntyajo'pi vā |
pumān nāryathavā klībaḥ sarve mokṣādhikāriṇaiḥ || 32 ||

madanugrahapātro yaḥ sarvo mokṣāya kalpate |
matprasādavihīnāya vratametanna rocate || 33 ||

jñānena na vinā mokṣaḥ siddhyet kenāpi suvrate |
jñānaṃ ca na vinā'nena śāmbhavena vratena tu || 34 ||

<p. 31> vratametad dvividham

vaidikaṃ tāntrikaṃ ceti vratametad dvidhā bhavet |
dvijānāṃ vaidikaṃ proktamanyeṣāṃ tāntrikaṃ smṛtam || 35 ||

nityaṃ naimittikaṃ vā'pi kriyate gṛhamedhinā |
madārādhanabuddhyā yatkarma tad jñānasādhanam || 36 ||

garujaṅgamaliṅgārcāsādhanaṃ yad bhaved bhuvi |
kuṭumbake vinirdiṣṭaṃ paramaṃ mokṣasādhanam || 37 ||

tatkarma ca kuṭumbaṃ vā na muktipatharodhakam |
liṅganiṣṭhāgariṣṭhasya viduṣo gṛhamedhinaḥ || 38 ||

madbhaktagaṇasaṃsevānirbharānandavaibhavam |
gṛhamedhīva samprāptuṃ kathaṃ pātrī bhavedyatiḥ || 39 ||

viraktaścedyatirbhūyādavirakto gṛhī bhavet |
yatiḥ sannaviraktaścennarakī kālamakṣayam || 40 ||

putradārānuṣaktaḥ sannaviraktaścarannapi |
manniṣṭhāyuktacittaśced gṛhī mukto bhaved dhruvam || 41 ||

<p. 32> jñānaṃ vimuktidaṃ proktaṃ nāśramo mokṣasādhanam |
jñānaniṣṭhā hi yasya syācchāmbhavavratapūrvikā |
ko'pi vā bhavatālloke sa hi bandhādvimucyate || 42 ||

tasmādidaṃ vrataṃ proktaṃ paramaṃ mokṣasādhanam |
ito'pi paripṛcchasva kimanyacchrotumicchasi || 43 ||

devyuvāca

kathamatra strīṇāmapyadhikāraḥ (?)

vratametaddhi nārīṇāmanuṣṭheyaṃ kathaṃ bhavet |
purastādvā parastādvā kartavyaṃ pāṇipīḍanāt || 44 ||

kathaṃ purastād yujyeta striyaḥ karmaṇi vaidike |
adhikārastu tadyogyavivāhāsaṃskṛtatvataḥ || 45 ||

parastād yadi gṛhyeta bhartṛtastvathavā'nyataḥ |
gṛhyate śāmbhavī dīkṣā bhartṛśced guruḥ sa hi || 46 ||

guruḥ pitā bhavettasya kathaṃ patnī bhavediyam |
anyataścedbhavet tasyā anyaśeṣatvamāgatam |
patyurgurorvā vacasi sthātavyamanayā punaḥ || 47 ||

<p. 33> saṅkalpādhikṛtirnāsti yoṣitāmiti kathyate |
tāsāmasyāṃ hi dīkṣāyāmadhikāraṃ kathaṃ bhavet || 48 ||

aviśrāntamanīṣāyā gṛhakṛtyairanārataiḥ |
jñāne labhetāvakāśaḥ patimatyāḥ kathaṃ prabho || 49 ||

liṅganiṣṭhāparāyāḥ syāt kathaṃ putrādipālanam |
kathaṃ vā bhartṛśuśrūṣā kathaṃ putrādipālanam || 50 ||

patireva hi nārīṇāṃ paramaṃ daivataṃ bhavet |
tāsāṃ kathaṃ nu yujyeta devatopāsanaṃ vada || 51 ||

mahādeva uvāca

strīṇāṃ dīkṣāgrahaṇaprakāraḥ

vramāvaśyakamidaṃ kathyate yoṣitāmapi |
anuṣṭheyaṃ parastādvai niyataṃ pāṇipīḍanāt || 52 ||

brāhmaṇīnāṃ hi dīkṣāyā grahaṇaṃ bhartṛto varam |
bharttaryaśakte grahaṇamanyato vā viśiṣyate || 53 ||

abrāhmaṇīnāṃ yujyeta bhartṛto grahaṇaṃ nahi |
abrāhmaṇasya patyurvā nopadeṣṭṭatvamiṣyate || 54 ||

<p. 34> patnyā bhartṛgurau caiva bhartrā patnīgurāvapi |
gurudṛṣṭirvidheyo syādanyathā patato dhruvam || 55 ||

yataḥ patnī gurorājñāvidheyā bharturapyataḥ |
tasmādanyagurutve'pi na bādhā yoṣito bhavet || 56 ||

guruṇā hyupadiṣṭāyā nānyaśeṣatvamiṣyate |
tadanyena hi bhuktāyā eva syādanyaśeṣatā || 57 ||

nijabharturgurutve'pi na doṣo yoṣito bhavet |
pitṛtā tasya gauṇī syānaiva mukhyā bhavedyataḥ || 58 ||

sa eva mātā ca pitā deva ityupacaryate |
na tāvatā bhartṛbhāryāsambadho bādhyate dhruvam || 59 ||

saṅkalpādhikṛtistāsāṃ nāsti svargyeṣu karmasu |
siddhā vimokṣādhikṛtirna niroddhuṃ hi śakyate || 60 ||

yathā'cārye pitari ca devatābuddhirucyate |
tathaiva bhartari proktā na sā devaniṣedhinī |
tataśca devatopāstiḥ śastā syādyoṣitāmapi || 61 ||

<p. 35> patipatnītvasambandho na nityaḥ kalpito hi saḥ |
nārīnaratvādikamapyaihajanmikamīritam || 62 ||

naiva strī na pumāneṣa naiva cāyaṃ napuṃsakaḥ |
yadyaccharīmādhatte tena tena sa lipyate || 63 ||

nārītvamaihikaṃ vā'pi bhāryātvaṃ kalpitaṃ tathā |
nirundhataḥ kathaṃ tanvyāḥ panthānaṃ mokṣagāminam || 64 ||

devavadbhāvito vā'pi guruvatsevito'pi vā |
madupāstiṃ vinā mūrkhastārayet sa kathaṃ satīm || 65 ||

vratamidaṃ nārīṇāmapyanuṣṭheyam

saṃsaran bhavakāntāre nimajjan duḥkhavāridhau |
atīrṇastu svayaṃ mūrkhastārayet sa kathaṃ satīm |
tasmādavaśyaṃ nārīṇāmanuṣṭheyaṃ vrataṃ bhavet || 66 ||

adīkṣāsaṃskṛtā nārī dīkṣitasya nijeśituḥ |
na yogyā paricaryāyai dīkṣiṇīyā satī tataḥ || 67 ||

adīkṣāsaṃskṛtā nārī yaṃ yaṃ pākaṃ karoti ca |
sa sa naivārhati kila pāko mahyaṃ niveditum || 68 ||

<p. 36> adīkṣāsaṃskṛtā nārī parispṛśati yajjalam |
abhiṣekakriyādīnāṃ mama nārhati tajjalam || 69 ||

pāratantryaṃ hi nārīṇāmuktaṃ svargyeṣu karmasu |
aihikeṣvapi mokṣārthe na svātantryaṃ vihanyate |
tasmādavaśyaṃ nārīṇāṃ dīkṣā deyā budhottamaiḥ || 70 ||

liṅganiṣṭhā'virodhena svakṛtyānyanupālayet |
na duṣyate tato nārī bhartṛśuśrūṣaṇādiṣu || 71 ||

patiṃ paricarantī ca śvaśvrādīn poṣayantyapi |
pālayantyapi putrādīn liṅganiṣṭhāṃ na vismaret || 72 ||

yathaiva bālāpatyāyāḥ kurvantyā bhavanakriyāḥ |
bālāyattaṃ yathā cittaṃ dīkṣitāyāstahocitam |
tato na gṛhakṛtyāni bādhante madupāsanām || 73 ||

liṅganiṣṭhāparā bhūtvā manniṣṭhāyuktacetasaḥ |
patyuḥ saṃsevanād bhartrā matsayujyaṃ gamiśyati || 74 ||

devyuvāca

rajaḥprabhavaduṣṭāyāḥ prasavāśaucasaṃgateḥ |
liṅgasparśanapūjādyāḥ karaṇīyāḥ kathaṃ prabho || 75 ||

<p. 37> mahādeva uvāca

arcā hyavasarābhikhyā gṛhiṇīnāṃ tu sammatā |
na mantrā vaidikā yogyā yoṣitāṃ tāntrikāḥ smṛtāḥ || 76 ||

rajodoṣādīnāmapravṛttiḥ

dīkṣāpavitritāṅgatvād liṅgasparśo na duṣyate |
rajovattvādikāleṣu kāryā pūjā prayatnataḥ |
prasavapramukhāpatsu pūjābhaṅgo na doṣadaḥ || 77 ||

devyuvāca

vaidikī vā'thavā dīkṣā tāntrikī yoṣitāṃ bhavet |
vaidikī yadi pūjāyāṃ mantrāḥ syustāntrikāḥ katham || 78 ||

tāntrikī yadi dampatyodīkṣābhedaḥ parasparam |
siddhastayoḥ kathaṃ nu syāt sāṅgatyaṃ sarvakarmasu |
tamenaṃ saṃśayaṃ chindhi karuṇāvaruṇālaya || 79 ||

mahādeva uvāca

dīkṣe hyubhe vikalpena yujyete dvijayoṣitām |
tāntrikyāmadhikāraḥ syādbhartuṃ strīṇāṃ svatantrataḥ || 80 ||

<p. 38> vaidikatāntrikadīkṣāvikalpaḥ

pumāṃsamagrataḥ kṛtvā vaidikyāṃ paratantrataḥ |
dīkṣābhedastu dampatyorna sāṅgatyanirodhaḥ || 81 ||

athādhikārasaṃprāptaḥ strīpuṃsordharmabhedavat |
sarvamuktaṃ samāsena kimataḥ śrotumicchasi || 82 ||

[iti śrīkāraṇāgame uttarabhāge pārvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
śāmbhavadīkṣāmāhātmyakathanaṃ nāma dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 2 ||




[tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

devadeva mahādeva jagadīśa namo'stu te |
śāmbhavavratināṃ nityamāhnikaṃ brūhi me'dhunā || 1 ||

mahādeva uvāca

śāmbhavavratināmāhnikam

brāhme muhūrte madbhakto buddhyamāno nagātmaje |
netrayoḥ sparśayanniṣṭaliṅgaṃ māmanusaṃsmaret || 2 ||

gurūpadiṣṭamārgeṇa dvādaśānte'thavā hṛdi |
divyarūpamarūpaṃ vā cintayenmāmananyadhīḥ || 3 ||

dharmānarthāṃśca tatkleśān dinakṛtyaṃ ca cintayet |
tathā catvāri karmāṇi sandhyāyāṃ na samācaret |
bhuktiṃ ca kāminīsaktimadhītiṃ suptimeva ca || 4 ||

udayatyastamayati ravau supyati cennaraḥ |
prāṇānāyamya ca japenmūlamaṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 5 ||

<p. 40> madbhaktaṃ bhasmarudrākṣaṃ māṃ ca vilvamahīruham |
prātaḥkāle tu yaḥ paśyet so'bhīṣṭaṃ samavāpnuyāt || 6 ||

pāṣaṇḍaṃ bhavinaṃ vrātyaṃ yācaṃ devanindakam |
prātaḥkāle tu yaḥ paśyet so'niṣṭaṃ samavāpnuyāt || 7 ||

śaucavidhiḥ

tato grāmād bahiryāyādāgneyīṃ vidiśaṃ naraḥ |
śarakṣepamitāṃ tatra jalapātraṃ nidhāya vai || 8 ||

nivītaṃ śivasūtraṃ ca mūrdhni vinyasya vāsasā |
śiraḥ prāvṛtya nordhvaṃ ca nādhaścaiva vilokayan || 9 ||

somamagnimathādityaṃ kurvannābhimukhaṃ dvijaḥ |
tataśca visṛjenmūtraṃ purīṣaṃ ca samāhitaḥ || 10 ||

ato mṛdā vāriṇā ca bhāvaśuddhisamanvitaḥ |
śaucaṃ tu yatnataḥ kuryādanyathā niṣphalāḥ kriyāḥ || 11 ||

apavitraḥ pavitro vā sarvāvasthāṃ gato'pi vā |
yaḥ smaredvai virūpākṣaṃ sa bāhyābhyantaraḥ śuciḥ || 12 ||

<p. 41> śaucaṃ vidhāya vidhivaddhastapādaṃ viśodhya ca |
jalaṃ mahyaṃ samarpyaiva gaṇḍūṣān visṛjettadā || 13 ||

saṃbaddhaśikha āsīno vāṅmanaḥkāyasaṃyutaḥ |
kṛtvopavītaṃ savyāṃse tata ācamanaṃ caret || 14 ||

antarjānukaro bhūmimadhaḥ kāyaṃ tathā spṛśan |
udaṅmukhastu tīrthena brāhmeṇopaspṛśejjalam || 15 ||

supte kṣute ca niṣṭhīve paridhāne'śrunirgame |
kṛtvā mūtrapurīṣe ca śaucārthī samupaspṛśet || 16 ||

upasparśe tathā snāne niyataṃ sarvakarmasu |
kuśagrahaḥ praśastaḥ syānna śastaḥ paitṛke bhavet || 17 ||

dantadhāvanam

ācamya prāṅmukho nityamācared dantadhāvanam |
madhurityādimantreṇa śākhāṃ samabhimantrya ca || 18 ||

<p. 42> āyurbalaṃ yaśo varcaḥ prajāḥ paśuvasūni ca |
brahmā prajñāṃ ca medhāṃ ca tvaṃ no ehi vanaspate |
iti samprārthya mantreṇa dhāvayecchākhayā tathā || 19 ||
sarve kaṇṭakinaḥ śastāḥ kṣīriṇo dantadhāvane |
na vilvaśākhayā kuryād dantaśuddhiṃ kadācana || 20 ||

snānakarma

dantaśuddhiṃ vidhāyātha prātaḥsnānaṃ samācaret |
mahānadyo devakhātāstaṭākāśca sarāṃsi ca |
gartapraśravaṇadīni śastāni snānakarmaṇi || 21 ||

rūpaṃ tejo balaṃ śaucamāyurdhṛtirarogatā |
medhāduḥsvapnanāśaśca guṇāḥ snānasya kīrtitāḥ || 22 ||

madālayasamīpe tu yattoyaṃ paritiṣṭhate |
śivagaṅgeti vijñeyā tatra snātvā labhet mām || 23 ||

malasnānaṃ mantrasnānaṃ ca 

nadyādikān samāgamya snānaṃ kuryādviśeṣataḥ |
malasnānamidaṃ proktaṃ mantrasnāmatha śṛṇu || 24 ||

saṅkalpaḥ sūktapaṭhanṃ mārjanaṃ cāghamarṣaṇam |
devatātarpaṇaṃ caiva snānaṃ pañcāṅgamucyate || 25 ||

matsyamaṇḍūkasarpādyairanekairjalajantubhiḥ |
sevitaṃ tu jalaṃ nityaṃ tasmād duṣṭaṃ bhavedataḥ || 26 ||

hastamātrapramāṇen paritaścaturaśrakam |
huṃphaḍantena cāstreṇa mṛdaṃ gṛhṇīta sādhakaḥ || 27 ||

aghoreṇa viśoddhyaiva puruṣeṇa tribhāgakam |
pūrvasmin dakṣiṇe caiva tathā caivottare kṣipet || 28 ||

īśānena tu mantreṇa cekaikamabhimantrayet |
astraṃ brahmaśivaṃ japtvā pūrvādi kramaśo nyaset || 29 ||

astrajaptaṃ tu yadbhāgaṃ daśadikṣu vinikṣipet |
śivajaptaṃ tu yadbhāgaṃ tīrthamadhye vinikṣipet || 30 ||

phaṭkāreṇāstramantreṇa tathā nārācamudrayā |
jale sūkṣmāśca ye doṣāsteṣāmuccāṭanaṃ bhavet || 31 ||

<p. 44> brahmajaptasya cārdhena cātmano'ṅgāni kuṇṭhayet |
śiro vaktraṃ ca hṛdayaṃ pādau guhyaṃ ca bhāgaśaḥ || 32 ||

śeṣārdhenopasaṃspṛśya snātvā'dbhistu punaḥ punaḥ |
upaspṛśya tathā snāyācchivatīrthasya madhyataḥ || 33 ||

śivabrahmāṅgavidyāṅgaiḥ snānaṃ kṛtvā vicakṣaṇaḥ |
pañcabrahmaśivāṅgaiśca triḥ paṭhedaghamarṣaṇam || 34 ||

tataḥ śivātmakairmantraistoyaṃ kṛtvā śivātmakam |
mārjanaṃ saṃhitāmantraistattoyena samācaret || 35 ||

astreṇa mantritaṃ toyaṃ vāmanāsāgramānayan |
iḍayāntargataṃ tena dagdhameno vicintayet || 36 ||

bahirgataṃ piṅgalayā bhāvayan dakṣiṇe kare |
dhṛtvā jalaṃ tatra pāpapūruṣaṃ bhāvayettataḥ || 37 ||

<p. 45> vāmabhāge vajraśilāṃ dhyātvā tatra kṣipejjalam |
cūrṇitaṃ bhāvayet pāpanaramityaghamarṣaṇam || 38 ||

devādīṃstarpayed vidvān mūlamantrajapena ca |
devaṃ māṃ madgaṇāṃścaiva tarpayecchuddhamānasaḥ || 39 ||

bhasmasnānam 

prātaḥsnāne mṛttikayā nānulimpeccharīram |
tatastu dhautavasane dhṛtvā tvaktvā''rdravāsasī || 40 ||

iṣṭaliṅgaṃ kare nyasya majjayitvā ca vāriṇā |
bhasmasnānaṃ tataḥ kuryācchuddhāntaḥkaraṇaḥ śuciḥ || 41 ||

bhasmasaṃgṛhya mūlena ṣaḍvāramabhimantrya ca |
śira īśānamantreṇa puruṣeṇa mukhaṃ tathā || 42 ||

hṛtpradeśamaghoreṇa vāmadevena guhyakam |
pādau sadyena sarvāṅgaṃ praṇavenaiva secayet || 43 ||

bhasmanā vihitaṃ snānamidamāgneyamuttamam |
śuṣkeṇa bhasmanā limpet sarvāṅgaṃ mūlamuccaran |
uddhūlanamidaṃ paścād sajalenaiva kuṇṭhayet || 44 ||

<p. 46> vāmapāṇitalanyaste ṣaṭkoṇaṃ bhasmani nyaset |
praṇavaṃ tanmukhe caiva vāyakārau bhujadvaye || 45 ||

śikāraṃ yantramadhye ca namakārau padadvaye |
vilikhya mūlamantreṇa ṣaḍvāramabhimantrayet || 46 ||

uttamāṅge lalāṭe ca karṇayornetrayordvayoḥ |
nāsāvaktragaleṣvevamaṃsadvitayake tathā || 47 ||

kūrpare maṇibandhe ca hṛdaye pārśvayordvayoḥ |
nābhau guhyadvaye caiva ūrvoḥ sphgbimbajānuṣu || 48 ||

uaṅghādvaye ca padayordvātriṃśatsthānake tathā |
bhasma tripuṇḍraṃ saṃdhārya rudrākṣān bibhṛyāttataḥ || 49 ||

rudrākṣadhāraṇam 

śikhāyāmekarudrākṣaṃ triṃśattu śirasā vahet |
ṣaṭtriṃśattu gale dadyād bāhvoḥ ṣoḍaśa ṣoḍaśa || 50 ||

<p. 47> dvādaśa maṇibandhe'pi skandhe pañcaśataṃ vahet |
aṣṭottaraśatairmālāṃ japayajñe prakalpayet || 51 ||

dvisaraṃ trisaraṃ vā'pi sarāṇāṃ pañcakaṃ tu vā |
saptakaṃ daśakaṃ vā'pi bibhṛyāt kaṇṭhadeśataḥ || 52 ||

makuṭe kuṇḍale caiva karṇikāhārakeṣu ca |
keyūrakaṭake caiva kakṣabandhe viśeṣataḥ || 53 ||

triśataṃ tvadhamaṃ pañcaśataṃ madhyamamucyate |
sahasramuttamaṃ proktamevaṃ bhedena dhārayet || 54 ||

sandhyopāsanapūjane 

tataḥ sandhyāmupāsīta prāṇāyāmapurassaram 
madīyasandhyakopāstiḥ sandhyopāstiḥ prakīrtitā |
saviturmaṇḍalasvāmī sāvitrīdevatā'smyaham || 55 ||

sandhyākāle madanyā tu devatā yadyupāsyate |
catvāri tasya naśyanti hyāhuḥ prajñā yaśo balam || 56 ||

tat trisandhyamupāsyo'hamāntaraḥ savituḥ paraḥ |
bhargamukhyābhidhānaśca prāṇadhīcodakaḥ sadā || 57 ||

<p. 48> aruṇasyodaye sūryasyodaye saṅgave tathā |
madhyāhne ca tataḥ sāyamardharātre ca suvrate |
uttamairarcanīyo'haṃ ṣaṭkālaṃ bhaktiśālibhiḥ || 58 ||

arghyāntāṃ samanuṣṭhāya sandhyāṃ śaivīṃ ca sādaram |
aruṇasyodaye kuryāt pūjāṃ tātkālikīṃ tataḥ || 59 ||

japed bhānūdayāntaṃ ca sāvitrīṃ yatamānasaḥ |
upatiṣṭhecca saviturantaraṃ māmananyadhīḥ || 60 ||

tato bhānūdaye kuryānmadarcāṃ homamapyatha |
japet ṣaḍakṣarīṃ sāṅgāṃ śrīrudrādīn viśeṣataḥ || 61 ||

sarvebhyo dravyayajñebhyo japayajño viśiṣyate |
japayajñaṃ samāpyaivaṃ gurvādīnabhivādayet || 62 ||

aṣṭabhāgamahaḥ kṛtvā hyādyamevaṃ samāpayet |
dvitīyabhāge tvabhyasyed vedān divyāgamānapi || 63 ||

śāstrāṇi āṭhayecchiṣyānmattattvaṃ bodhayedapi |
tadā samācared bhaktyā pūjāṃ saṅgavakālikīm || 64 ||

samitkuśādīn homārthaṃ ca prayatnataḥ |
puṣpāṇi vilvapatrāṇi guggulvādīni cāharet || 65 ||

tṛtīyabhāge kurvīta yatnaṃ poṣyārthasiddhaye |
tathā caturthabhāge tu snānārthaṃ mṛdamāharet || 66 ||

śivatīrthaṃ tu saṃpādya mṛdā'ṅgānyupalipya ca |
snānaṃ mādhyāhnikaṃ kṛtvā sandhyādvayamupāsya ca |
tataḥ pañca mahāyajñāḥ kartavyā gṛhiṇā mudā || 67 ||

pañcayajñāḥ

devānāṃ ca pitṝṇāṇm ca bhūtānāṃ ca nṛṇāmapi |
brahmaṇaśca vinirdiṣṭāḥ pañcayajñā nagātmaje || 68 ||

juhoti samidhādyagnau devayajñaḥ prakīrtitaḥ |
dadātyapaḥ pitṛbhyo'yaṃ pitṛyajña itīritaḥ || 69 ||

baliṃ harati bhūtebhy bhūtayajña udāhṛtaḥ |
manuṣyayajñaḥ sa hi yad viprebhyo'nnaṃ prayacchati |
yat svādhyāyamadhīyīta brahmayajña itīryate || 70 ||

<p. 50> apasavyaṃ vidheyaṃ syādagniṣvāttāditarpaṇe |
punastanna vidheyaṃ syāt svapitṝṇāṃ tu tarpaṇe || 71 ||

tato mādhyāhnikī pūjā kāryā gurvī laghustu vā |
mahatī vā yathāśakti śraddhābhaktiyutātmanā || 72 ||

paṇḍito vā'tha mūrkho vā priyo vā dveṣya eva vā |
samprāpto yastu pūjānte sa evāhaṃ na saṃśayaḥ || 73 ||

matto'dhiko jaṅgamo hi sa pūjyo gṛhamāgataḥ |
annapānādibhiścaiva tadabhīṣṭapradānataḥ || 74 ||

evaṃ jaṅgamamārādhya prasādamupabhujya ca |
sukhamāshāya maccittastadannaṃ pariṇāmayan || 75 ||

matstotrāṇi paṭhedvā'pi purāṇānyabhyasettu vā |
āsāyamatha kurvīta yatnaṃ poṣyārthasiddhaye || 76 ||

sāyaṃkṛtyāni

tataḥ snātaḥ śucirbhūtvā bhsmasnānaṃ vidhāya vā |
upāsya paścime sandhye homakāryaṃ samāpya ca |
kṛtvā sāyantanīṃ pūjāṃ vaiśvadevaṃ samācaret || 77 ||

<p. 51> vidhāyā'tha yathāśakti matpūjāmardharātrikīm |
sāyamāyāntamatithiṃ pūjayedatibhaktitaḥ || 78 ||

yatpātakaṃ bhaved devi vimukhe ca divātithau |
sāyaṃ hi vimukhe tasmiṃstadaṣṭaguṇitaṃ bhavet || 79 ||

tasmāt svaśaktyā sampūjya sūryoḍhamatithiṃ dvijaḥ |
prasādamupabhujyātha matstotrāṇi paṭhedapi || 80 ||

ātmābhirucitāṃ śayyāmadhiṣṭhāya śucistu mām |
smaran samādhimāsthāya śayītā'rvākchirāḥ sukham || 81 ||

itthamuktaṃ kṛtyajātamāhnikaṃ yanmayā priye |
dvijānāṃ mama bhaktānāṃ matpadaprāptisādhanam || 82 ||

[iti śrīkāraṇāgame uttarabhāge pārvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
āhnikavidhirnāma tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 3 ||


[caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

devadeva mahādeva sarveśvara namo'stu te |
aśrauṣamāhnikaṃ deva bhaktānāmiṣṭadāyakam || 1 ||

arcāviśeṣān grahaṇaviśeṣaniyamānapi |
raṅgavallīvidhānaṃ ca vartikāsādhanaṃ tathā || 2 ||

yogyāni patrapuṣpāṇi tadīyagrahaṇaṃ tathā |
śrotumicchāmi bhagavan vada me karuṇānidhe || 3 ||

mahādeva uvāca

śṛṇu vakṣyāmi nagaje na gopyaṃ tvayi vidyate |
matpūjā trividhā laghvī gurvī ca mahatī tathā || 4 ||

pūjātrayavidhānam 

uttamo mahatīṃ kuryād gurvīṃ madhyama eva ca |
laghvīmaśaktaḥ kuryācca sāyaṃ mādhyāhnike tathā || 5 ||

<p. 53> avasarā bhojane proktā prātarādiṣu suvrate |
trikālamarcanāṃ kuryācchaktaḥ ṣaṭkālameva vā || 6 ||

dvijo'ruṇodaye snātvā savitre'rghyaṃ pradāya ca |
madarcanāṃ vidhāyaiva sāvitrīṃ prajapennaraḥ || 7 ||

yāvat sūryodayaḥ paścādupatiṣṭhedahaskaram |
japayajñaṃ vidhāyaivaṃ pūjāmudayakālikīm || 8 ||

kuryāt tathā saṅgave ca madhyāhne ca yathākramam |
sāyaṃ sandhyāmupāsyārcyāṃ kuryāt sāyantanīṃ tathā || 9 ||

ādyayāme samārabhya dvitīye tu samāpayet |
gṛhī niśyardharātrārcāṃ śraddhābhaktisamanvitaḥ || 10 ||

naktaṃ dvitīyayāmasya bhāgāvādyantagau matau |
gṛhiṇaśca yaterdharātrapūjāvasānagau || 11 ||

grahaṇaniyamāḥ

uparāgo bhavedyāme prathame cet tadānaghe |
dvitīyayāme kartavyā mama pūjārdharātrikī || 12 ||

uparāgo yadā yāme dvitīye vā tṛtīyake |
arcāmavasarāṃ kṛtvā na bhuñjīta dvijastadā |
naktavratī yadi punarviśeṣastvadhunocyate || 13 ||

uparāgo yadā yāme dvitīye vā tṛtīyake |
yāmāt purastāt kartavyā mama pūjā na bhojanā || 14 ||

somoparāge paurastyastyājyo yāmastu bhojane |
tatpūrvaḥ śasyate kālo nityanaktopajīvinām || 15 ||

graste'pyastamite bhānau nopavāso niyujyate |
yataḥ prasādaḥ saṃsevyo niyataṃ naktabhojinām || 16 ||

padmabhadratattvamaṇḍalāni

padmaṃ bhadraṃ tathā tattvamaṇḍalaṃ hi kramottamam |
arcanocitapātrāṇāṃ vinyāsāya prakīrtitam |
sitataṇḍulacūrṇena padmaṣṭadalaṃ bhavet || 17 ||

aṣṭau pūrvāgragā rekhā likhet tiryak tathā punaḥ |
ekonapañcāśatkoṣṭhacakramevaṃ bhavet tataḥ || 18 ||

sūkṣmapadmāni vinyasyet ṣaṭtriṃśatkoṣṭake tathā |
trayodaśasu madhyeṣu likhedaṣṭadalāmbujam |
daśāyudhāni vinyasyet parito maṇḍalaṃ punaḥ || 19 ||

<p. 55> pūrve tu svastikaṃ śaṅkhamāgneye kamalaṃ tathā |
dakṣiṇe cāmaraṃ chatraṃ nairṛtyāṃ pañcakoṇakam || 20 ||

paścime nāgabandhaṃ ca vāyau ṣaṭkoṇameva ca |
uttare ḍamaruṃ śūlamaiśāne tvaṣṭakoṇakam || 21 ||

etalliṅgārcanāpātravinyāsārhaṃ mama priyam |
bhadramaṇḍalamākhyātaṃ bhadradaṃ muktidaṃ param || 22 ||

saptatriṃśallikhed rekhā ūrdhvāgrāstiryagapyatha |
ṣaṇṇavatyuttaradvādaśaśatātmakakoṣṭhakam || 23 ||

cakraṃ bhavati tanmadhye ṣaṭtriṃśaddalavārijam |
paritaḥ sarvakoṣṭheṣu sūkṣmapadmāni saṃlikhet |
daśāyudhāni vinyasyet parito maṇḍalaṃ budhaḥ || 24 ||

iṣṭaliṅgārcanāpātravinyāsāyottamottamam |
tattvamaṇḍalamākhyātaṃ tattvānubhavasādhanam || 25 ||

padmaṃ tvavasarākhyāyāṃ laghvyāmapi samīritam |
bhadramaṇḍalamukhyāni gurvyādiṣu ca vinyaset || 26 ||

<p. 56> dīpārpaṇam 

laghvyāmavasarāyāṃ vā jvālayed dīpamekakam |
gurvyāṃ mahatyāmapi ca dvau vā'tha caturo'pi vā || 27 ||

nīrājanatrayaṃ proktamavasarākhyapūjane |
ādyaṃ darśanasaṃjñaṃ syānmajjanākhyaṃ dvitīyakam |
tṛtīyamavasarākhyamevaṃ saṃpūjayet priye || 28 ||

nīrājanānāṃ navakaṃ laghvyāmuktaṃ varānane |
prathamaṃ darśanākhyaṃ syādavasarākhyaṃ dvitīyakam || 29 ||

majjanākhyaṃ tṛtīyaṃ tu māṅgalyākhyaṃ caturthakam |
karpūrākhyaṃ pañcamaṃ syāt ṣaṣṭhaṃ śṛṅgārasaṃjñakam || 30 ||

saptamaṃ tu mahāsaṃjñamānandākhyamihāṣṭakam |
asaṃkhyātābhidhaṃ caitannavamaṃ parikīrtitam || 31 ||

sānurāgābhidhaṃ tāmbūlābhikhyaṃ ca mahārcane |
gurvarcane'pi hi bhavantyekādaśa priyavrate || 32 ||

vartikāvidhānam 

tisrastvavasarākhyāyāṃ vartikā vihitā iha |
nava dvādaśa vā proktā vartikā laghupūjane || 33 ||

aṣṭādaśātha ṣaṭtriṃśadvā proktā gurupūjane |
ānavakramasaṃkhyā vā tathā ṣaṇṇavatistu vā || 34 ||

<p. 57> aṣṭottaraśataṃ vā'tha triśataṃ vā sahasrakam |
mahatyāṃ mama pūjāyāṃ vartikā jvālayedapi || 35 ||

ṣaṭtriṃśattantubhiḥ kuryādvartikā mama pūjane |
phalaṃ tisṛbhireva syādaṣṭottaraśatoditam || 36 ||

pūjocitāni puṣpapatrāṇi 

atha vakṣyāmi puṣpāṇi pūjāyāṃ matpriyāṇi vai |
nandyāvartaśriyāvartakaravīrabakāni ca || 37 ||

droṇapunnāgamandārajalajārkotpalānyapi |
lodhradhuttūranirguṇḍīvilvāśokamunīnyapi || 38 ||

eteṣu śubhravarṇāni mamātyantapriyāṇi vai |
etāni sāttvikāni syurmuktidāni bhavanti hi || 39 ||

etāni rājasāni syurbhogasiddhikarāṇi ca |
miśrāṇi pītavarṇāni bhogamokṣapradāni hi || 40 ||

tāmasānyasitāni syurvinā nīlotpalaṃ priye |
pūjāyāmupayujyeranna kadāpi nitambini || 41 ||

<p. 58> kadambaṃ campakaṃ caiva punnāgaṃ bṛhatī tathā |
a'svamedhaphalaṃ dadyurvasante mahyamarpaṇāt || 42 ||

pāṭalī mallikā caiva śatapatraṃ mamārpitam |
agniṣṭomaphalaṃ dadyurgrīṣmatau varavarṇini || 43 ||

aśvamedhaphale syātāṃ rāvṛṣyāmbujamallike |
nīlotpalaṃ ca kahlāraṃ dhuttūraṃ jātireva ca |
satrayāgaphalaṃ dadyuḥ śaradyarpaṇato mama || 44 ||

jātirnīlotpalaṃ caiva karavīramapi priye |
śatakratuphalaṃ dadyācchiśire karṇikārakam || 45 ||

puṣpeṣvāragvadhadroṇe patre vailvamapi dhruvam |
praśastatamamākhyātaṃ matpūjāyāṃ varānane || 46 ||

droṇādipuṣpaiḥ sauvarṇaiḥ kṛtaṃ yad vilvapatrakaiḥ |
tadanantaphalaṃ vidyāt pūjanaṃ mama pārvati || 47 ||

patrāṇāmapi puṣpāṇāṃ sauvarṇānāmiha kvacit |
nahi nirmālyatādoṣastasmāt tairnityamarcayet || 48 ||

karānītaṃ paṭānītaṃ dhṛtameraṇḍapatrataḥ |
apavitrajanānītaṃ patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalaṃ tyajet || 49 ||

cyutaṃ bhuvi tathā''ghrātamakiñjalkaṃ sakīṭakam |
avṛntaṃ savraṇaṃ puṣpaṃ pūjāyāṃ nopayujyate || 50 ||

jalajaṃ sthalajaṃ vā'pi yathotpannaṃ tathaiva ca |
patrāṇyapi tathā nyasyed vilvapatramadhomukham || 51 ||

sarvopari nyased vilvaṃ vilvopari na kiñcana |
sarvopari nyasedbhasma bhasmopari na kiñcana || 52 ||

matpūjā kriyate hyevaṃ kaivalyaṃ labhate dhruvam |
sarvamuktaṃ samāsena kimataḥ śrotumicchasi || 53 ||

[iti śrīkāraṇāgame uttarabhāge pārvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
raṅgavalyādikathanaṃ nāma caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 4 ||



[pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ] 


devyuvāca

devadeva mahādeva pañcakṛtyaparāyaṇa |
jagadīśvara sarvātman bhūyo bhūyo namo'stu te || 1 ||

pūjopayuktapātrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇāni viśeṣataḥ |
pūjākāle sādhakena vartitavyaṃ yathā punaḥ || 2 ||

abhiṣekadravyajātaṃ niyamānarcakasya ca |
brūhi sarvamaśeṣeṇa prāṇinirvāṇakāraṇam || 3 ||

mahādeva uvāca

pūjākāle kathaṃ vartitavyam

puṣkalāccopakaraṇānmanonairmalyasaṃbhavaḥ |
nirmalenaiva manasā pūjakaḥ phalabhāg bhavet || 4 ||

sāmagrīsannidhānena pūjā sā puṣkalā bhavet |
puṣkale pūjane bhaktaḥ puṣkalāṃ śriyamaśnute || 5 ||

pūjopayuktasāmagrīṃ sannidhāya sukhāsane |
samāsīnaḥ saniyamaḥ pūjayenmāmananyadhīḥ || 6 ||

<p. 61> asannidhāya sāmagrīṃ saṃkalpyopaviśan janaḥ |
punaryatena mūḍhātmā na pūjāphalabhāg bhavet  || 7 ||

ajño vā'pyathavā prājñaḥ sāmagrīṃ nāhvayet svayam |
madhye madhye samāhūya cañcalo na phalī bhavet || 8 ||

bhaktaḥ saṃkalpya pūjāyai na krūddhyet paricārakān |
pūjakaḥ krodhasaṃkruddhaḥ sannidhiṃ nābhigacchati || 9 ||

ālasyaṃ jṛmbhaṇaṃ nidrāṃ pūjākāle vivarjayet |
varjayeviṣayāsaktiṃ punaḥ kuryānmadarpitam || 10 ||

madarpitamanā yadyadalabdhaṃ kusumaṃ dalam |
sannidhāyātha yatnena manasaivārpayenmayi || 11 ||

yastu saṃkalpya pūjāyai kāryāntaraniyojitaḥ |
tatkāryaṃ manasi smṛtvā na pūjāphalamaśnute || 12 ||

pūjāmadhye yadekena preṣito mahatā'pi vā |
tvarayenmama pūjāyāṃ naiti māṃ tasya pūjanam || 13 ||

<p. 62> guruṇā yadi vā''hūtaḥ pūjāṃ tasya nivedayet |
nivedite'pi cāhūtastadājñāṃ paripālayet || 14 ||

gururyato'haṃ deveśi nāvayorvidyate bhidā |
abhedabhāvanāṃ jñātvā tadājñāṃ paripālayet || 15 ||

ākhyāti pūjāvelāyāṃ vaidikaṃ yadvicakṣaṇaḥ |
tanmayaivoditamiti nirvahet svaprayatnataḥ || 16 ||

avaidikasyākhyātṝṇāṃ nikaṭe nopaveśayet |
pratyākhyānaṃ na kurvīta pidadhyācchravaṇadvayam |
nekṣeta pūjāvelāyāṃ naraṃ devi bahiṣkṛtam || 17 ||

pūjākāle yadākhyātaṃ śaivakāryamanuttamam |
kuryāt sarvaprayatnena tadaśaktau tu kārayet || 18 ||

pūjakaḥ saṃsmaret karma laukikaṃ tvarayed yadi |
śivadroheṇa niryāti kālabhairavayātanām || 19 ||

saṃsmarannapi karmāṇi yo mayyāhitamānasaḥ |
sa yāti māmakaṃ rūpaṃ kailāse madgaṇaiḥ saha |
modate tasya nāvṛttistena sarvaṃ vaśīkṛtam || 20 ||

<p. 63> puṣpaṃ patraṃ phalaṃ toyaṃ śramasādhyaṃ yathā yathā |
phalaṃ tathā tathā teṣāṃ dātā'haṃ hi sadāśivaḥ || 21 ||

puṣpalobhaḥ patralobhaḥ pātralobho bhayāvahaḥ |
tasmāt sarvaprayatnena pātraṃ patraṃ sumaṃ tathā |
saṃpādya pūjayelliṅgaṃ yathāvibhavavistaram || 22 ||

pātrādilakṣaṇam 

suvarṇapātraṃ yatnena kusumādidalāni ca |
sauvarṇānyeva saṃpādya pūjanīyastvahaṃ śive |
rājataṃ vā daridraścet tāmrapātraṃ hi kalpayet || 23 ||

virakto nārikelena pātreṇaiva yajet svayam |
sauvarṇapātrapūjā'pi na tasyāḥ sadṛśī bhavet || 24 ||

vilvanirmitapātraṃ tu sarveṣāmuttamottamam |
tatpātrasadṛśaṃ loke nāsti nāsti mahītale || 25 ||

pātreṣu vailvaṃ ślāghyaṃ syād vailvaṃ patreṣu cottamam |
nīlotpalaṃ ca puṣpeṣu pūjārthamuttamottamam || 26 ||

<p. 64> sarvamaprākṛtairmantraiḥ kṛtvā mahyaṃ samarpayet |
śuddhabhāvaḥ samabhyarcya yathoktaphalabhāg bhavet || 27 ||

svanandanodbhavaṃ patraṃ puṣpaṃ phalamanuttamam |
āraṇyakāni puṣpāṇi patrāṇi svayamarcayet |
śūdrānītaiḥ krayakrītaiḥ karma kurvan patatyadhaḥ || 28 ||

arkadroṇotpalādyaiśca vilvāragvadhapatrakaiḥ |
tilākṣatairarcayenmāṃ bhaktiyuktena cetasā || 29 ||

arghyādipātrāṇi

pūjopayuktapātrāṇāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ śṛṇu pārvati |
sāmānyārghyābhidhaṃ caiva pādārghyācamanāni ca || 30 ||

tyāgajñānānandasaṃjñānyatha snānajalasya ca |
pādaprasādodakayostrīṇyādhārābhidhāni ca |
śivakumbhasamākhyaṃ ca pātrāṇyekādaśa priye || 31 ||

tathā'nyāni ca pātrāṇi bhavantyāvaśyakāni hi |
gandhāderapi dhūpasya dīpānāṃ ca viśeṣataḥ || 32 ||

<p. 65> ghaṇṭāṃ śaṅkhaṃ darpa'ṃ ca chatraṃ cāmarameva ca |
tālvṛntaṃ ca saṃpādya yajenmāṃ liṅgarūpiṇam || 33 ||

śivakumbhābhidhaṃ pātraṃ kuryād viṃśatibhiḥ palaiḥ |
pātraṃ daśapalaiḥ kuryāt sāmānyārghyasamākhyakam || 34 ||

sārdhasaptapalaiḥ kuryāt pādyārghyācamanāni ca |
tyāgajñānānandakāni kuryāt pañcapalairapi |
ādhārābhikhyapātrāṇi sārdhadvipalamānataḥ || 35 ||

śivakumbhaṃ ca sāmānyamarghyapātraṃ tathaiva ca |
sthūlodaraṃ tathā kuryānmukhagrīvāvibhūṣitam || 36 ||

pādyārghyācamanākhyāni caturasrāṇi kārayet |
tyāgajñānānandakāni vartulānītarāṇi ca || 37 ||

gandhādipātraṃ kurvīta vṛttamaṣṭadalānvitam |
dīpapātrāṇi kuryācca ḍamarvākāravanti ca || 38 ||

trimukhīṃ ṣaṇmukhīmekamukhīṃ nīrājanāya ca |
chatraṃ saṃpādayed dhīmān muktājālavibhūṣitam || 39 ||

sauvarṇāderalābhe tu kiṃśukaiḥ khaḍgaśṛṅgataḥ |
atha yajñīyavṛkṣeṇa mṛdā pātraṃ tu kārayet || 40 ||

<p. 66> pūjanavidhiḥ

nadītīre taṭāke vā svayaṃvyaktaśivasthale |
vijane svagṛhe vā'pi yajedekāgramānasaḥ || 41 ||

vilvāṣṭottarasāhasraṃ śatamaṣṭottaraṃ tu vā |
droṇapuṣpasahasrairvā puṣpairvāthārkasaṃbhavaiḥ || 42 ||

āragvadhasahasrairvā niyamenaiva pūjayet |
śatamaṣṭottaraṃ vā'pi cāṣṭāviṃśatisaṃkhyayā || 43 ||

pūjākāle bahuvaco yasya tena na saṃvaset |
śivasyaiva purāṇāni śrāvayecchṛṇuyādapi |
laukikānyakathālāpaṃ varjayenmama pūjakaḥ || 44 ||

svārāmodbhavapuṣpāṇi praśastāni madarcane |
devasvaṃ devatodyānapuṣpāṇi parivarjayet |
anyapūjārhapuṣpāṇi na ca mahyaṃ samarpayet || 45 ||

samarpaṇīyānyanyena na ca puṣpāṇi yācayet |
yācanālabdhapuṣpāṇyapraśastāni madarcane || 46 ||

asannidhāya naivedyaṃ dhūpadīpau na cācaret |
dhūpadīpau samarpyātha na vilambennivedane || 47 ||

<p. 67> abhiṣekāya divyāni dravyāṇi kalaśe kṣipet |
elośīralavaṅgāni kastūrīṃ candrasaṃjñakam |
pañcadravyāṇi kalaśe cūrṇayitvā vinikṣipet || 48 ||

siddhārthān kuṅkumaṃ dūrvāṃ kuṣṭhaṃ candanabhasmanī |
candraṃ ca kusumaṃ caiva pādyapātre vinikṣipet || 49 ||

siddhārthāṃśca kuśāgrāṇi yavavrīhitilānyapi |
candanaṃ bhasma kusumamarghyapātre vinikṣipet || 50 ||

triphalājātikarpūrakuṣṭhakośīrameva ca |
bhasmacandanapuṣpāṇi pātre hyācamane kṣipet |
bhasmacandanapuṣpāṇi pātreṣvanyeṣu nikṣipet || 51 ||

tyāgapātre kuduṣṇaṃ ca jñānapātre sacandanam |
ānandapātre śītaṃ ca jalamāpūrayet tathā || 52 ||

nimīlayannetrayugmaṃ dhyānaṃ samyak samācaret |
dhyānakāle purāṇādiśravaṇaṃ naiva kārayet |
ekānte mīlitākṣeṇa dhyānaṃ kāryaṃ vipaścitā || 53 ||

abhiṣeke purāṇādiśravaṇaṃ netaratra tu |
manodārḍhyena sampannaḥ pūjayenmāṃ dṛḍhavrataḥ || 54 ||

alaṅkārapriyo viṣṇurabhiṣekapriyo'smyaham |
namaskārapriyo bhānurmama stotrapriyā gaṇāḥ || 55 ||

<p. 68> stptrapāṭho viśeṣeṇa mama tu prītivardhanaḥ |
stotramātreṇa saṃtuṣṭastvahamiṣṭaphalapradaḥ || 56 ||

dhyānena sakalaṃ pāpaṃ naśyed bhaktārjitaṃ tu yat |
dhyānānuguṇamevānyanmukhyaṃ dhyānaṃ prakīrtitam || 57 ||

sauvarṇau ca kaṭāhau dvau śuddhatoyena pūritau |
gandhadravyeṇa miśrau ca kṛtvā māmabhipūjayet || 58 ||

elālavaṅgajātīyaphalapuṣpāṇyuśīrakam |
lavaṅgatvagjāṭāmāṃsyau takkolaṃ kuṣṭhameva ca || 59 ||

kadambakandaṃ gandhatvaṅ nāgakesaracampakān |
devadāruṃ gugguluṃ ca kauṅkumaṃ puṣpameva ca || 60 ||

gorocanaṃ ca karpūraṃ tathā sarvamaṇiṃ samam |
cūrṇayitvā viśeṣeṇa kastūrīṃ ca vinikṣipet |
sarvadravyāṇi nikṣipya pūjayelliṅgarūpiṇam || 61 ||

sarvadravyeṣvalabdheṣu kastūrīkuṅkumānvitam |
karpūraṃ caiva pūjārthaṃ saṃpādya paripūjayet |
elośīrairdaridraścenna kevalajalairyajet || 62 ||

<p. 69> yathā yathā ca sāmagrī viśiṣyeta madarcane |
tathā tathā phalaṃ proktaṃ bhaktānāṃ kilbiṣaṃ nahi || 63 ||

dīpārārtiṃ prakurvīta sauvarṇai rājatairatha |
sapuṣpamarpayed bhaktaḥ svasya vijñānasiddhaye || 64 ||

jñānasiddhirbhavennṝṇāṃ mayi dīpasamarpaṇāt |
viśeṣāt somavāre ca dīpāvalisamarpaṇāt || 65 ||

kārtike somavāre tu dīpāvalisamarpaṇāt |
nā punarjāyate bhakto mama sāyujyamāpnuyāt || 66 ||

pradoṣe somavāre lakṣadīpasamarpaṇāt |
phalaṃ vaktuṃ na śakyeta so'hameveti niścitam |
tasmādajñānanāśāya dīpārcanamathācaret || 67 ||

namaskārāṣṭakaṃ kuryādaṣṭottaraśataṃ tu vā |
sahasraṃ vā prakurvīta namaskārapriyo'smyaham || 68 ||

karapīṭhe samabhyarcya sāmbaṃ māṃ liṅgarūpiṇam |
atha bhakto namaskāraṃ kaṇṭhordhvaṃ tu vibhāvayet || 69 ||

muktāṅguṣṭhena muṣṭyā ca pradakṣiṇavidhānavān |
prārthayenmāṃ maheśāni yathākāmamatandritaḥ || 70 ||

<p. 70> arghyaṃ cāpyunmanīmudrāsamañcitakarāmbujaḥ |
cinmudrayā ca puṣpāṇi pātrāṇi ca samarpayet || 71 ||

chatreṇācchādayetpaścāccāmareṇāpi vījayet |
tālavṛntena cāpyevaṃ darpaṇaṃ darśayedapi || 72 ||

ghaṇṭāravaṃ kārayecca śaṅkhamādhmāpayedapi |
gītāni śrāvayedeva vādyaṃ nṛtyaṃ samarpayet || 73 ||

pūjāgṛhavidhānam

śivapūjāgṛhaṃ śuddhaṃ śvetacūrṇena lepitam |
gomayenopaliptaṃ ca raṅgavalyādyalaṅkṛtam || 74 ||

puṣpaiḥ parṇairalaṅkṛtya mallījhillīṃ prasārayet |
sugandhadravyacūrṇaiśca dhūpayed devatāgṛham || 75 ||

nīḍāni bhittau kurvīta nānāvarṇalasanti ca |
vinyased vigrahānāśu teṣu māmakakiṅkarān || 76 ||

sāyudhāna vāhanairyuktānalaṅkāravibhūṣitān |
bhasmatripuṇḍrarudrākṣabhāsvaddehān kapardinaḥ || 77 ||

athavā bhūtirudrākṣān teṣu nīḍeṣu nikṣipet |
mama pūjārthasāmagrīmathavā vinyased budhaḥ |
teṣu teṣu ca nīḍeṣu dīpamālāṃ ca kalpayet || 78 ||

pūjanakarmasampādanam 

tasmin susadane devi sukhāsīnaḥ śubhāsane |
bhasmatripuṇḍrarudrākṣamāikāsamalaṅkṛtaḥ || 79 ||

bhadrādimaṇḍalanyastasarvopakaraṇāñcitaḥ |
sakalīkṛtadehaśca kṛtapāriṣadastutiḥ || 80 ||

agre siṃhāsanavaraṃ vibhāvya samalaṅkṛtam |
bhasmaśayyāñcitaṃ tatra karapīṭhaṃ vidhāya ca || 81 ||

tasminnikṣipya māṃ nityaṃ ṣaṭtriṃśadupacārakaiḥ |
ṛgyajuḥsāmavedaiśca tathā'tharvaṇamantrataḥ || 82 ||

pañcākṣaropaniṣadā purāṇaśravaṇādinā |
śāstrāṇāṃ paṭhanenāpi gadyapadyastutivrajaiḥ || 83 ||

gāyet svayaṃ gāpayecca mama māhātmyasūcakaiḥ |
vādyaiśca vividhairgītairnṛtyairmāṃ paritoṣayet || 84 ||

<p. 72> ekādikramaśo mahyaṃ dadyādārārtikān nava |
jāghaṇṭāśaṅkhanādaiśca kolāhalaravairapi || 85 ||

śabdabrahmānandamayo madānandāmṛtaplutaḥ |
nimajjanniva saṃtuṣṭo niḥsaṃjñaḥ iva tatparaḥ || 86 ||

yaḥ sakṛdvā'sakṛdvā'pi māmarcayati yaḥ svayam |
sa dhanyaḥ sarvalokānāṃ vandyo bhaktottamottamaḥ |
taṃ dṛṣṭvā modate yastu tamādapyadhiko bhavet || 87 ||

yaḥ svakīyagṛhe nityaṃ madbhaktānāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
pūjopakaraṇaṃ dattvā kārayet tairmadarcanam |
sa yāti mama sāyujyaṃ jñānināmapi durlabham || 88 ||

itthamuktaṃ mayā tubhyaṃ lokānāṃ muktisiddhaye |
pātrādisādanaṃ devi kimataḥ śrotumicchasi || 89 ||

[iti śrīkāraṇāgame uttarabhāge pārvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
pūjāpātrādilakṣaṇakathanaṃ nāma pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 5 ||


[ṣaṣṭhaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

candraśekhara bhūteśa pinākinnugra śaṅkara |
avasarādipūjānāṃ kalpaṃ brūhi viśeṣataḥ || 1 ||

mahādeva uvāca

avasarapūjākalpaḥ

athāvasarapūjāyāḥ kalpaṃ vakṣye śṛṇu priye |
maṇḍalaṃ parikalpyādau dīpaṃ prajvālayet tataḥ || 2 ||

parigṛhya gaṇānujñāṃ ghaṇṭānādapurassaram |
mannāmabhiḥ samācamya prāṇānāyamya śaktitaḥ || 3 ||

saṃkīrtya deśakālau ca kalaśaṃ samyagarcayet |
aṣṭottaraśatānyūnāṃ japenmama ṣaḍakṣarīm || 4 ||

sarvaliṅgaṃ sthāpayatīti liṅgaṃ vinyaset kare |
nīrājanaṃ darśanākhyamasau ya iti darśayet || 5 ||

<p. 74> yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavān pṛthvītyabhyukṣya bhasmanā |
etāvānasya mahimetyāmanan pādyamarpayet || 6 ||

haṃsaḥ śuciṣadityarghyaṃ sāvitryā''camanīyakam |
namaḥ somāya cetyevam snānaṃ ca parikalpayet || 7 ||

snānodakaṃ śirasyukṣya liṅgatīrthaṃ pragṛhya ca |
ṛtaṃ satyamiti prāśya vastraṃ yastantviti bruvan || 8 ||

agnirityādibhirbhasma sarvato lepayet sudhīḥ |
gandheti gandhamādadyādākāśāditi cākṣatān || 9 ||

nidhanapataya iti puṣpāṇi ca samarpayet |
vilvaṃ triyambakamiti yacca vyometi dhūpakam || 10 ||

<p. 75> mahānīrājanaṃ dadyānna tatreti manuṃ smaran |
dadyādavasaraṃ naivedyamācārādiliṅgakaiḥ || 11 ||

īśāna iti mantreṇa mantrapuṣpaṃ samarpayet |
vastraprāvaraṇaṃ kuryāt so'bravīditi mantrataḥ |
aṇoraṇīyāniti ca liṅgaṃ svāṅge niveśayet || 12 ||

laghvarcāvidhiḥ

atha vakṣyāmi deviśi laghumarcāvidhiṃ śṛṇu |
snātaḥ śuciryatamānāḥ kṛtabhasmāvaguṇṭhanaḥ || 13 ||

dhṛtatripuṇḍro rudrākṣamālālaṅkṛtavigrahaḥ |
ācamya dīpaṃ prajvālya saṃprārthya ca gaṇānmama || 14 ||

ācamya prāṇānāyamya deśakālau prakīrtya ca |
saṃbhavadbhiriha dravyairiṣṭaliṅgasya pūjanam || 15 ||

<p. 76> kariṣya iti saṃkalpya saṃpūjya kalaśaṃ tathā |
ṣaḍakṣarajapaṃ kuryādaṣṭottaraśataṃ budhaḥ || 16 ||

iṣṭaliṅgaṃ kare dhṛtvā sarvaliṅgamanuṃ paṭhan | 
āvāhayecca vedāhaṃ bhāvagrāhyamiti bruvan |
nīrājanaṃ darśanākhyamasau ya iti darśayet || 17 ||

yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavān pṛthvītyabhyukṣya bhasmanā |
etāvanasya mahimetyāmanan pādyamarpayet || 18 ||

haṃsaḥ śuciṣadityarghyaṃ sāvitryā''camanīyakam |
yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavānāpa ityabhiṣicya ca || 19 ||

liṅgatīrthaṃ ca saṃgṛhya kadrudrāyeti mantrayan |
ṛtaṃ satyamiti praśya puṣpaṃ dhūpaṃ samarpya ca || 20 ||

yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavān yaścāgniriti mantrataḥ |
dattvā cāvasarābhikhyaṃ nīrājanamapi priye |
phalādyavasaraṃ dadyād bhasma liṅgopari kṣipet || 21 ||

mūlena puṣpaṃ nikṣipya dhūpamāghrāpayet priye |
asau yo'vasarpatīti mantremenamanusmaran |
nīrājanaṃ majjanākhyaṃ darśayed girinandinani || 22 ||

<p. 77> etāvanasya mahimetyāmanan pādyamarpayet |
haṃsaḥ śuciṣadityarghyaṃ sāvitryā''camanīyakam || 23 ||

rudrādhyāyenābhiṣekamāvahantīti mantrataḥ |
vastreṇodvartanaṃ kṛtvā liṅgatīrthaṃ pragṛhya ca |
kadrudrāyeti saṃmantrya prāśnīta ṛtamityapi || 24 ||

yo vai rudra iti paṭhan dadyādaṅgāratāpanam |
yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavān yaścāgniriti dhūpanam || 25 ||

uddīpyasveti ca paṭhan māṅgalyākhyaṃ ca darśayet |
vastraṃ samarpayed devi yastantviti manuṃ paṭhan || 26 ||

agnirityādibhirmantraiḥ sajalaṃ bhasma cārpayet |
namo harikeśāyeti yajñasūtraṃ samarpayet || 27 ||

yo vai rudro yā ca pṛthvītyuktvā gandhāṃśca sākṣatān |
ākāśāditi mantreṇa dadyāt kevalamakṣatān || 28 ||

<p. 78> sarvavyāpinamiti karpūranīrājanaṃ diśet |
tadevartaṃ bhuvantaya iti mālyāni cārpyaet || 29 ||

yā te rudra śivā tanūḥ śivā viśvāhabheṣajī |
iti nīrājanaṃ dadyācchṛṅgārākhyaṃ maheśvari || 30 ||

yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavān yaśca sūrya iti kramāt |
nidhanapataya iti cāṣṭottaraśatena ca |
puṣpāṇi tryambakamiti vilvapatrāṇi cārpayet || 31 ||

nama īdhriyāya ceti śvetacchatraṃ samarpayet |
namo vātyāya cetyevaṃ cāmaraṃ parikalpayet || 32 ||

candramā manaso jāta iti vyajanamarpayet |
sa yaścāyaṃ puruṣa ityarpayed darpaṇaṃ tathā || 33 ||

yo vedādāviti paṭhan ghaṇṭānādaṃ ca śrāvayet |
adhyavocadadhityevaṃ śaṅkhaṃ samyaṅ ninādayet || 34 ||

<p. 79> śivena vacasā tveti gītamāśrāvayed budhaḥ |
namo dundubhyāya ceti vādyaṃ kuryād vicakṣaṇaḥ |
namo rudrāyātatāyina iti nāṭyaṃ ca darśayet || 35 ||

udyantamiti mantreṇa budhaḥ kuryāt pradakṣiṇam |
yo rudro'gnāviti paṭhan namaskāraṃ samarpayet || 36 ||

namo rudrāya cetyuktvā stutipāṭhaṃ paṭhed budhaḥ |
ajāta ityevamiti paṭhan yāñcāṃ vibhāvayet || 37 ||

yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavān yacca vyometi dhūpakam |
na tatra sūryo bhātīti mahānīrājanaṃ diśet || 38 ||

<p. 80> aghorebhyo'tha iti cācāraliṅgādibhiḥ kramāt 
caturvidhaṃ ca naivedyamarpayet sādhakastataḥ || 39 ||

bhasmābhyukṣya mahāliṅge īśāna iti mantrataḥ |
mūlamantreṇa cāpyevaṃ mantrapuṣpaṃ samarpayet || 40 ||

yato vāco nivartanta iti mantraṃ paṭhannapi |
ānandābhikhyakaṃ nīrājanamapyarpayet tataḥ || 41 ||

sa viśveti ca tāmbūlaṃ yo brahmāṇamiti bruvan |
puṣpāñjaliṃ ca vikirannātmānamapi cārpayet || 42 ||

asaṃkhyā iti mantreṇāsaṃkhyanīrājanaṃ diśet |
vastraprāvaraṇaṃ kuryāt so'bravīditi mantrataḥ |
aṇoraṇīyāniti ca kuryāt svāṅge niveśanam || 43 ||

<p. 81> ityukto hi mahā devi laghurārādhanāvidhiḥ |
matsāyujyaprado hyeṣa yathoktamanutiṣṭhatām || 44 ||

[iti śrīkaraṇāgame uttarabhāge pārvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
pūjāvidhikathanaṃ nāma ṣaṣṭhaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 6 ||



[saptamaḥ paṭalaḥ] 

devyuvāca

devadeva mahādeva lokānugrahatatpara |
tvatpūjākarṇanādasmi kṛtārthā jagadīśvara || 1 ||

mahāpūjāṃ ca śuśrūṣurasmi lokaikakāraṇa |
tadvidhānaṃ ca sambodhya kṛpayā'nugṛhāṇa mām || 2 ||

mahādeva uvāca

mahāpūjākramaḥ 

atha vakṣye mahādevi mahāpūjāvidhikramam |
snātaḥ śuciryatamanā dhṛtadhautāmbaradvayaḥ || 3 ||

dhṛtatripuṇḍro rudrākṣamālālaṅkṛtavigrahaḥ |
kṛtasandhyādikaḥ sampāditapuṣpādisādhanaḥ || 4 ||

bhadrādimaṇḍalanyastapūjāpātraḥ sukhāsanaḥ |
catuṣṭayaṃ dīpikānāṃ prajvālya dvayameva vā || 5 ||

gaṇān saṃkīrtya cācamya prāṇānāyamya sakramam |
deśakālau susaṃkīrtya ceṣṭaliṅgasya prītaye || 6 ||

raṅgavalyāṃ tu sāmānyamarghyapātraṃ niveśya ca |
bhasmacandanapuṣpāṇi tatra nikṣipya nirmalam || 7 ||

jalamāpūrya vai bindusravatpīyūṣadhārayā |
pūritaṃ bhāvayanneva pañcabrahmaṣaḍaṅgakaiḥ |
mantraiḥ sammantrya saṃskāraiḥ saṃskuryādvakṣyamāṇakaiḥ || 8 ||

nirīkṣaṇaṃ prokṣaṇaṃ ca tāḍanaṃ cāvaguṇṭhanam |
abhyukṣaṇamiti khyātā vastusaṃskārakārakāḥ |
dhenvākhyayā'mṛtīkṛtya padmaliṅge pradarśayet || 9 ||

tataḥ pādyārghyācamanapātrāṇyapi ca paṅktiśaḥ |
taduttareṇa vinyasyet pādyapātre yathākramam || 10 ||

siddhārthān kuṅkumaṃ dūrvāṃ kuṣṭhaṃ karpūrameva ca |
bhasmacandanapuṣpāṇi nikṣipet sādhakottamaḥ || 11 ||

ṣaḍaṅgairjalamāpūrya sadyadyairabhimantrya ca |
taduttarepyarghyapātre kuśādīn vikṣipet tathā || 12 ||

<p. 84> hṛdayena jalaṃ kṣiptvā mūlenaivābhimantrya ca |
taduttare tvācamanapātre bhasmādi nikṣipet |
ṣaḍaṅgairjalamāpūrya sadyādyairabhimantrayet || 13 ||

tyāgajñānānandapātrāṇyapi tatpūrvato nyaset |
bhasmacandanapuṣpāṇi tyāgapātre nidhāya ca |
uṣṇaṃ vai jalamāpūrya prāsādenābhimantrayet || 14 ||

taduttare jñānapātre bhasmādīni nidhāya vai |
candanodakamāpūrya cāghoreṇābhimantrayet || 15 ||

taduttarānandapātre bhasmādīni nidhāya ca |
śītalodakamāpūrya vāmadevena mantrayet || 16 ||

tatpūrve snānapādaprasādavārigṛhītaye |
vinyasettatra cādhārapātrāṇi trīṇi paṅtiśaḥ || 17 ||

sāmānyasyārghyapātrasya śivakumbhaṃ puro nyaset |
tatra bhasmādi nikṣipya tadā pānīyakaṃ jalam || 18 ||

<p. 84> hṛdayenaiva saṃpūryā kalaśeṣviti mantrataḥ |
āpo vā idaṃ sarvamityanenābhimantrya ca || 19 ||

pūjādravyāṇi samprokṣya tasmāduddhṛtavāriṇā |
sāmānyārghyādipātrāṇi mūlenābhyarcya vai tataḥ |
sāmānyārghyagataṃ toyaṃ pādyāditriṣu nikṣipet || 20 ||

gurumabhyarcya niyataṃ yasya deveti mantrataḥ |
tīrthaprasādau gṛhṇīyānmatpūjāyogyatāptaye || 21 ||

iti bhaktasthalaṃ proktamatha māheśvarasthale |
ayaṃ me hasta  iti tu hastaśuddhiṃ vidhāya vai || 22 ||

māheśvarasthalapūjāvidhānam 

sarvabhūtasthamiti ca kṛtvā bhasmāsanaṃ kare |
vedāhametamiti ca liṅgamādāya tadgṛhāt |
sarvaliṅgaṃ sthāpayatīti liṅgaṃ nikṣipet kare || 23 ||

rudra yatte dakṣiṇaṃ mukhamityāvāhayet tadā |
guruṃ dhyātvā ṣaḍaṅgaṃ ca nyāsaṃ samyagvidhāya ca |
sahasraṃ ṣaṭchataṃ vā'pi japedeva ṣaḍakṣarīm || 24 ||

prasādisaṃjñake paścāt sthale liṅge ca bhasma vai |
abhyukṣya nānudhyāyecca tamevaikamiti smaran || 25 ||

daśāvadhānavidhinā nirīkṣya ṣveṣṭaliṅgakam |
nīrājanaṃ sānurāgaṃ yā te rudreti nirdiśet || 26 ||

prāṇaliṅgasthale bhasma liṅgopari nidhāya ca |
mūlenaiva hi liṅgāgre puṣpaṃ nikṣipya mantritam || 27 ||

pādyārghyācamanaṃ dadyāt tattatpātrodakena hi |
tyāgapātrasthitenaiva liṅgaṃ saṃsnāpya vāriṇā || 28 ||

ādhārapātreṇādāya samprokṣya nijamūrdhani |
āvahantīti mantreṇa vastreṇodvartya sādaram || 29 ||

<p. 87> bhasmāsane nidhāyaiva pādau liṅgasya bhāvayan |
praṇamyābhyarcya pādyaṃ ca jñānapātrajalena vai || 30 ||

dattvaitajjalamādhārapātreṇādāya sannaman |
kadrudrāyeti saṃmantrya pibedṛtamitīrayan || 31 ||

liṅgamūlena gandhādyairalaṅkṛtya tataḥ param |
yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavān yaścāgniriti mantrataḥ |
nīrājanaṃ tvavasarābhikhyaṃ dattvā phalādikam || 32 ||

samarpyānandapātrodaṃ gṛhṇannādhārapātrataḥ |
samarpya prāśya tatpātraṃ nikṣipedapyadhomukham || 33 ||

athācamanapātrasthatoyenācamanīyakam |
dattvā tatsavituriti tyāgapātrasthavāriṇā || 34 ||

namakādyai rudrasūktairabhiṣicyātha tajjalam |
namaḥ śambhava ityātmamūrdhani prokṣayet tathā || 35 ||

<p. 88> āvahantīti vastreṇa samudvartyeṣṭaliṅgakam |
bhasmāsane nidhāyāsya gṛhṇīyāt pādatīrthakam || 36 ||

tato vidhūmamaṅgāramānīyānena tāpayet |
yovai rudraḥ sa bhagavān yaścāgniriti mantrataḥ || 37 ||

yo vai rudraḥ sa bhagavān yacca vyometi mantrataḥ |
daśāṅgamahitaṃ mahyaṃ dhūpaṃ dadyānmanoharam || 38 ||

uddīpyasveti ca tato māṅgalyākhyaṃ ca darśayet |
yastantunābha iti ca vastrayugmaṃ pradāya ca |
agnirityādibhirmantrairlimped bhasma sahodakam || 39 ||

namo harikeśāyeti pradadyād yajñasūtrakam |
gandhadvārāmiti paṭhan dadyād gandhaṃ sahākṣatam || 40 ||

umāsahāyamiti ca kuryād gandhānulepanam |
ākāśāditi vai dadyādakṣatāropaṇaṃ budhaḥ || 41 ||

<p. 89> apāṇipāda iti hiraṇyapātramiti bruvan |
nīrājanaṃ darśayecca karpūrākhyaṃ maheśvari || 42 ||

tadevartamiti paṭhan puṣpamālyāni cārpayet |
namo hiraṇyabāhave makuṭādi vibhūṣayet || 43 ||

yā te rudra śivā tanūḥ śivā viśvāhabheṣajī |
iti nīrājanaṃ dadyācchṛṅgārākhyaṃ maheśvari || 44 ||

nidhanapataye iti vedasārasahasrataḥ |
mūlenāpi ca puṣpāṇi patrāṇi ca samarpayet || 45 ||

vāditya iti vilvāni yo vai rudreti bhasma ca |
nama īdhriyāya ceti śvetacchatraṃ samarpayet || 46 ||

namo vātyāya ca paṭhan cāmaraṃ ca samarpayet |
candramā manasa iti tālavṛntena vījayet || 47 ||

sa yaścāyaṃ puruṣa iti darpaṇamarpayet |
yo vedādāviti paṭhan ghaṇṭānādaṃ samarpayet || 48 ||

adhyavocaditi paṭhan śaṅkhasvanamathārpayet |
śivena vacasā tveti gītamāśrāvayet tathā || 49 ||

<p. 90> asau yo'vasarpatīti paṭhan nṛttaṃ pradarśayet |
udyantamastaṃ yantamiti savyahastena kalpayet |
pradakṣiṇāni prayato mama liṅgasya sarvataḥ || 50 ||

namo'stu nīlagrīvāyetyāmanan vai namāsyapi |
namo vṛddhāya ca paṭhan stotraṃ kuryādananyadhīḥ || 51 ||

daivīyo mānuṣo gandha iti dhūpaṃ samarpayet |
nantatra sūryo bhātīti mahānīrājanaṃ tathā || 52 ||

īrāṃ vahata ityevaṃ jvālayet karadīpikāḥ |
jyotiṣmatīmiti paṭhan jyotīṃṣi jvālayedapi || 53 ||

kṛtāni śālipiṣṭena ḍamarupratirūpataḥ |
jyotīṃṣi tāni kathyante mama prītikarāṇyapi || 54 ||

yā te rudra iti paṭhan yācayenmāmananyadhīḥ |
ajāta ityevamiti vijñāpanamathācaret |
vedāntavijñāna iti pūjāpuṣpādikaṃ tyajet || 55 ||

<p. 91> nivedanārhavelāyāṃ patrapuṣpādikaṃ bahu |
sthitaṃ cediṣṭaliṅgāgre nipated bhojyavastuṣu || 56 ||

nirmālyasumasaṃsargānarhaṃ tat syānnivedanam |
tadalpaśeṣaṃ visṛjenna liṅgaṃ śūnyamastakam || 57 ||

śaraṇākhyasthale bhojyapadārtheṣvagnirityataḥ |
vikīrya sajalaṃ bhasma savyāhṛtikayā tathā || 58 ||

sāvitryā rudragāyatryā pariṣicyaivamambubhiḥ |
svāhāṃ tebhyastathācāraliṅgādibhyo'rpayet tataḥ |
ṣaḍliṅgārpaṇasadbhāve viśeṣo'sthi śṛṇu priye || 59 ||

bhaktasthale kriyāśaktiyute vai nāsikāṅgage |
ācāraliṅgasaṃjñe'smin sadyojātamukhātmake |
gandhaprasādaṃ sadbhaktyā cittahastena cārpayet || 60 ||

māheśvarasthale jñānaśaktike rasanāṅgake |
guruliṅgābhidhe vāmadevavaktre viśeṣataḥ |
buddhihastena tu ruciṃ niṣṭhābhaktyā samarpayet || 61 ||

<p. 92> sthale prasādisaṃjñe'sminnicchaktisamanvite |
d.gaṅgake'ghoramukhe śivaliṅgābhidhe punaḥ |
bhaktyā'vadhānayā rūpamahaṅkāreṇa cārpayet || 62 ||

prāṇaliṅgisthale tvādiśaktiyukte tvagaṅgake |
cāraliṅgā'bhidhe tat pūruṣavaktre dṛḍhavrataḥ |
bhaktyā'nubhavayā manohastena sparśamarpayet || 63 ||

śaraṇasthale tu parayā śaktyā yukte śravoṅgage |
prasādaliṅge tvīśānamukhe śabdaprasādakam |
ānandabhaktyā sujñānahastenaiva samarpayet || 64 ||

aikyasthale tu cicchaktiyute vai mānasāṅgage |
mahāliṅge paraśivamukhe saṃkalpamarpayet |
sadbhāvābhikhyahastena bhaktyā samarasākhyayā || 65 ||

evamaṅgaṃ ca liṅgaṃ ca bhaktiṃ śaktiṃ tathā sthalam |
mukhaṃ hastaṃ prasādaṃ ca jñātvā vai samyagarcayet |
evamarpaṇasadbhāvaṃ sarvadaiva samabhyaset || 66 ||

<p. 93> dvividhaṃ samarpaṇam

samarpaṇaṃ dvidhā proktamarcāṅgaṃ sarvakālikam |
samarpaṇe samarcāṅge ruciṃ bhāvena nānyathā || 67 ||

śaraṇākhyasthale'pyevamarpaṇaṃ ṣaṭsthalātmakam |
aikyasthale tu mūlena liṅge puṣpaṃ nidhāya ca || 68 ||

dhūpaṃ samarpya cānandanīrājanamathārpayet |
yato vāco nivartante iti mantraṃ japan punaḥ || 69 ||

sa viśvakṛditi paṭhan tāmbūlaṃ ca samarpayet |
ārabhyeti ca tāmbūlanīrājanamathārpayet || 70 ||

yo brahmāṇamitīśāna iti mantradvayena ca |
mantrayan pu'pajātaṃ vai mantrapuṣpaṃ samarpayet || 71 ||

asaṃkhyātāḥ sahasrāṇītyādimantraṃ samuccaran |
asaṃkhyātābhikhyanīrājanamapyarpayet  tataḥ || 72 ||

so'bravīditi mantreṇa vastreṇāvṛtya liṅgakam |
aṇoraṇīyāniti tu peṭikāyāṃ suvinyaset || 73 ||

<p. 94> evaṃ mahārcanaṃ proktaṃ mahādevi mahāphalam |
vidhinā'nena saṃpūjya na punarjanmabhāg bhavet |
deveśi gurupūjāyāṃ viśeṣaḥ kathyate śṛṇu || 74 ||

gurupūjāyāṃ viśeṣaḥ 

padyārghyācamanākhyāni tyāgajñānādikāni ca |
na vidyante'tra pātrāṇi pātradvitayameva ca || 75 ||

śivakumbhaṃ ca sāmānyamarghyapātraṃ ca vidyate |
śiṣṭaṃ sarvaṃ samaṃ proktaṃ kimataḥ śrotumicchasi || 76 ||

[iti śrīkāraṇāgame uttarabhāge śrīpārvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
śivapūjāvidhānaṃ nāma saptamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 7 ||



<p. 95> [aṣṭamaḥ paṭalaḥ] 

devyuvāca

devadeva jagannātha sarvānugrahatatpara |
vidhānamidamutkṛṣṭaṃ vedamantrasamanvitam || 1 ||

vedādhikāriṇāṃ samyaganuṣṭheyaṃ prakāśitam |
strīmukhyāḥ kena vidhinā kṛtārthāḥ syurnibodha me || 2 ||

mahādeva uvāca

mahādevi pravakṣyāmi tāntrikaṃ pūjanakramam |
anuṣṭhitena yena syuḥ sarve sarvārthabhājanāḥ || 3 ||

tāntrikapūjanakramaḥ 

vidyāsu śrutirutkṛṣṭā rudraikādaśinī śrutau |
tatra pañcākṣarastatra śiva ityakṣaradvayam || 4 ||

tasmādadhikṛtāṃ vede tatrā'nadhikṛtāmapi |
madīyamūlamantreṇa pūjanaṃ sarvato varam || 5 ||

athavā tāntrikairmantrairapi pūjā viśiṣyate |
eṣu bhātyupacārārthaḥ spaṣṭaḥ sarvo'pi bhāmini || 6 ||

<p. 96> vaidikeṣu tu mantreṣu liṅgādevaupacārikāt |
teṣu teṣūpacāreṣu vedamantrā niyojitāḥ || 7 ||

samanuṣṭhīyamāno'rtho yeṣu spaṣṭaṃ prakāśate |
teṣveva paṭhyamāneṣu cittaṃ kṛtye'nurajyate || 8 ||

bhaktilabhyo'smyahaṃ yasmādabhaktyā pūjanaṃ vṛthā |
tanmantrāstāntrikā devi pūjāyāmuttamottamāḥ || 9 ||

tāntrikapūjāyāṃ sarveṣāmadhikāraḥ

sarveṣāmadhikāro'sti tāntrikeṣu varānane |
vaidikānāṃ tathānyeṣāṃ strīṇāṃ puṃsāṃ ca suvrate || 10 ||

śivakumbhapūjanam 

vaidiko'pi ca saṃyuktaistāntrikairapi pūjayet |
īśāna iti mantreṇa śivakumbhaṃ prapūjayet || 11 ||

īśānaḥ kalaśasyāgre pūrve tatpuruṣastathā |
aghoro dakṣiṇe caiva sadyojātastu paścime || 12 ||

uttare vāmadevaśca madhye ca paramaḥ śivaḥ |
adhobhāge parā śaktirviśvodbhāsanakāriṇī || 13 ||

sadrūpaṃ kalaśākāraṃ cidrūpaṃ kalaśadyutiḥ |
madhyasthaṃ jalamutkṛṣṭaṃ sarvatīrthottamottamam || 14 ||

<p. 97> cidānandarasaṃ sākṣācchivarūpamiti smṛtam |
iti mantraiśca gandhādyaiḥ śivakumbhaṃ prapūjayet || 15 ||

iṣṭaliṅgapūjā

hṛdayādriguhāvāsa karuṇāvāsa śāśvata |
pūjāparigrahāyādya karapīṭhe niṣīda me ||
iti mantreṇeṣṭaliṅgaṃ vinyaset karapaṅkaje || 16 ||

pañcapañcātmalīlāḍhya pañcakṛtyaparāyaṇa |
āvāhitaḥ suprasannaḥ sānnidhyaṃ kuru sarvadā || 17 ||

ityāvāhya gurunnatvā nutvā saṃpūjya ca kramāt |
dhyātvā māṃ vai suprasannaṃ mūlamantraṃ japedapi ||
daśāvadhānavidhinā ciraṃ liṅgaṃ samīkṣya ca || 18 ||

sarvamaṅgalayā''śliṣṭaśubhāṅga hṛdayaṅgam |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇeśa sānurāgaṃ sadāśiva || 19 ||

nīrājanaṃ sānurāgamiti mantreṇa sarśayet |
tataśca mūlamantreṇa bhasma puṣpaṃ nidhāya ca || 20 ||

<p. 98> antasthita bahirvyāpta jyotirliṅgasvarūpaka |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇeśa darśanākhyaṃ sadāśiva ||
iti darśananīrājanaṃ datvā pādyamarpayet || 21 ||

harimukhyāmaraśiroratnanīrājitāṅghrika |
bhavatpādābjayoḥ pādyaṃ gṛhāṇa parameśvara ||
iti pādyaṃ samarpyaiva hastayorarghyamarpayet || 22 ||

varābhayāṅkitakarakañjapālitakiṅkara |
hastanīrejayorarghyaṃ gṛhāṇa girijāvara ||
iti cārghyaṃ samarpyāthācamanīyaṃ mukhe'rpayet || 23 ||

jagadābhīlakākolagolapālilasadgala |
śrīmanmukhāmbuje dattaṃ gṛhāṇācamanīyakam ||
dattvā''camanamityevaṃ snāpayediṣṭaliṅgakam || 24 ||

gaṅgātaraṅgasaṅgāñcitottamāṅga namo'stu te |
śuddhodakasnānamidaṃ gṛhāṇa parameśvara || 25 ||

<p. 99> iti saṃsnāpya ca tatastīrthaṃ mūrdhani nikṣipet |
pādodakaṃ gṛhītvā ca namaskuryādanantaram || 26 ||

sarvamaṅgalamāṅgalyaṃ sarvapāvanapāvanam |
sarvasiddhikaraṃ puṃsāṃ śambhoḥ pādāmbusevanam ||
iti prāśya tato liṅgaṃ gandhādyairabhipūjayet || 27 ||

cidrūpa jagadādhāra sthūlasūkṣma parātpara |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇeśāvasarākhyaṃ sadāśiva || 28 ||

ityavasarākhyanīrājanaṃ datvā phalādikam |
samarpya ceṣṭaliṅgāgre bhasmabhyukṣya sumādikam ||
dattvā majjananīrājanaṃ paścādabhidarśayet || 29 ||

paripūrṇacidānanda jalādhyakṣa sadāśiva |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇeśa majjanākhyaṃ suśobhanam || 30 ||

iti dattvā punaḥ pādyamarghyamācamanīyakam |
pūrvamantraiḥ pradāyātha snānaṃ ca parikalpayet || 31 ||

pañcabrahmamayatano pañcakṛtyaparāyaṇa |
pañcāmṛtasnānamidaṃ gṛhyatāṃ bhaktavatsala || 32 ||

<p. 100> ākāśavāhinīnaddhajaṭāpaṭalabhāsura |
śuddhodakasnānamidaṃ gṛhāṇa jagadīśvara || 33 ||

abhiṣekaṃ vidhāyaivaṃ tīrthaṃ svaśirasi kṣipet |
pādatīrthaṃ gṛhītvā'tha namaskṛtyā'dareṇa tu || 34 ||

bhavāmbunidhinistārasetave mokṣahetave |
pāpapraśamanārthāya pādatīrthāya te namaḥ || 35 ||

aśeṣajyotirudbhāsakottamajyotirātmaka |
aṅgāratāpanamidaṃ kuru śītāpanodanam ||
ityagninā vidhūmena tāpanaṃ saṃvidhāya ca || 36 ||

aśeṣavāsanonmūlakāraṇātmīyabhāsana |
dhūpasaṃvījanaṃ śambho gṛhyatāṃ bhaktavatsala ||
saṃvījya dhūpamityevaṃ punardhūpaṃ prasārayet || 37 ||

anantāṅgalyaguṇaratnaratnākarāyita |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇeśa māṅgalyākhyaṃ sadāśiva ||
iti māṅgalyanīrājanaṃ dattvā vastramarpayet || 38 ||

<p. 101> nṛsiṃhacarmottarīya gajājinapariṣkṛta |
vastrayugmamidaṃ śambho gṛhāṇa jagadīśvara ||
vastrayugamaṃ samarpyaivaṃ bhūtiṃ saṃdhārayet tataḥ || 39 ||

phālāgnidagdhapradyumnavapurbhasitabhūṣita |
śivāgnijamidaṃ bhasma dhriyatāṃ jagatāṃ pate |
iti saṃdhārya sajalaṃ bhasma gomayasaṃbhavam || 40 || 

phaṇāmaṇighṛṇībhrājināgayajñopavītaka |
yajñeśvara gṛhāṇeśa svarṇayajñopavītakam ||
iti mantreṇopavītaṃ datvā gandhaṃ samarpayet || 41 ||

kāmāṅgahasitālepasamujjvalaśubhāṅgaka |
sugandhī candrasambandhaḥ śrīgandhaḥ pratigṛhyatām ||
iti gandhaṃ sākṣataṃ ca dattvā tena vilepayet || 42 ||

akṣayānandasaṃdhāyakākṣayāṅgapradāyaka |
akṣatān sugṛhāṇeśa pakṣivāhanapūjita ||
iti śubhrākṣatān dattvā karpūraṃ dīpayet tataḥ || 43 ||

<p. 102> surayoṣāmaṇiśreṇīdattanīrājanojjvala |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇeśa karpūrākhyaṃ sadāśiva || 
iti karpūranīrājanaṃ dattvā mālyamarpayet || 44 ||

vidhiviṣṇukapālālimālālaṅkṛtavigraha |
mālyaṃ gṛhāṇa deveśa sumajālamanoramam ||
iti mālyaṃ pradāyāthābharaṇāni samarpayet || 45 ||

candramaḥkhaṇḍakoṭīraphaṇikuṇḍalamaṇḍita |
bhūṣaṇāni gṛhāṇeśa sauvarṇāni jagannuta ||
bhuṣaṇairityaṅkṛtya nānāratnasamujjvalaiḥ || 46 ||

bhavānībhāvamadhuralīlālokāvalokita |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇeśa śṛṅgārākhyaṃ sadāśiva || 47 ||

iti nīrājanaṃ dattvā pūjayet patrapuṣpakaiḥ |
aṣṭābhirnāmabhiścaivamaṣṭottaraśatena vā || 48 ||

puṣpavadrathacakrāḍhya puṣpāyudhavadhodyata |
nānāvidhāni pu'pāṇi gṛhāṇeśa namo'stu te ||
pu'pairevaṃ susaṃpūjya vilvapatrāṇi cārpayet || 49 ||

<p. 103> trisuparṇaṃ sphuradvarṇaṃ śriyā cīrṇaṃ suśobhanam |
kuṇḍalīkṛtagokarṇa gṛhāṇa śrīdruparṇakam ||
iti vilvadalaṃ datvā bhasma sarvopari kṣipet || 50 ||

kapardaveṣṭanānanta bhogacchatrapariṣkṛta |
śvetacchatraṃ gṛhāṇeśa muktādāmābhiśobhitam ||
chatramevaṃ samarpyātha cāmaradvayamarpayet || 51 ||

vidhiviṣṇukarābjodyaccāmaradvayavījita |
cāmarābhyāṃ vījayāmi prasīda karuṇālaya ||
cāmarābhyāṃ vījayitvā tālavṛntena vījayet || 52 ||

tālasaṃvādanavyagravidhitoṣitamānasa |
vījaye tālavṛntena karuṇāvarṇālaya ||
tālavṛntena saṃvījya darpaṇaṃ ca pradarśayet || 53 ||

ādarśavimalākārādarśabhāsvatkapolaka |
ādarśaṃ darśayāmyadya durdarśanijarūpaka ||
darpaṇaṃ darśayitvaivaṃ ghaṇṭānādaṃ samarpayet || 54 ||

<p. 104> nādasvarūpavilasadghaṇṭāśobhikarāmbuja |
ghaṇṭānādaṃ śrāvayāmi nādarūpa śṛṇu priyam ||
ghaṇṭhānādaṃ samarpyaivaṃ śaṅkhamāpūrayet tataḥ || 55 ||

śaṅgadhmānakriyāsaktagaṇendragaṇasaṃvṛta |
śṛṇu śaṅkharavaṃ deva kambugrīvamanoramam ||
śaṅkhaṃ ninādyaivamato gītamāśrāvayedapi || 56 ||

kambalāśvatarodgītasamākarṇanatatpara |
gītaṃ saṃśrāvayāmyadya bhavaccitracaritrakam ||
gītamāśrāvya ca tato vādyaṃ saṃśrāvayet tadā || 57 ||

murārivāditamahāmurajadhvanitoṣita |
vādyaṃ saṃśrāvaye śambho ḍamarudhvananapriya ||
iti vādyaṃ ninādyātha nṛttaṃ samyak pradarśayet || 58 ||

nijānandātirekotthamahātāṇḍavapaṇḍita |
nṛttaṃ viracayāmyadya mahānaṭa vilokaya || 59 ||

iti nṛttaṃ samarpyaiva kareṇābhinayātmakam |
muṣṭyaivāṅguṣṭhayutayā pradakṣiṇamathārpayet || 60 ||

<p. 105> pradakṣiṇakriyāsaktabrahmādisurasevita |
pradakṣiṇatrayaṃ kurve gṛhāṇa karuṇānidhe ||
pradakṣiṇatrayaṃ kṛtvā namaskuryādanekaśaḥ || 61 ||

namo namo bhūbhṛdapatyajānaye namo namo bhasmitacittayonaye |
namo namaḥ śikṣitabhānusūtave namo namo bhūṣitaśītabhāvane ||
namāṃsi tu samarpyaivaṃ stutiṃ kuryādanantaram || 62 ||

brahmaṇāṃ brahmaṇe tubhyaṃ rakṣitṝṇāṃ ca rakṣiṇe |
hartṝṇāmapi saṃhartre devadevāya te namaḥ ||
stutiṃ kṛtvā tataḥ kuryād dhūpasaṃvījanaṃ budhaḥ || 63 ||

mahāśmaśānadahanadhūmadhūpāvṛtāṅgaka |
dhūpasaṃvījanaṃ śambho gṛhyatāṃ bhaktavatsala || 64 ||

dhūpaṃ saṃvījya ca muhustathā dhūpaṃ prasārya ca |
mahānīrājanamapi prajvālya ca samarpayet || 65 ||

māṅgalyahetave sarvamaṅgalāliṅgitātmane |
maṅgalārthābhidhānāya mahādevāya maṅgalam ||
iṣṭaliṅgasvarūpāyābhīṣṭadāyāstu maṅgalam || 66 ||

<p. 106> prāṇeṣu ca manomadhye jyotirliṅgasvarūpiṇe |
prāṇagranthisvarūpāya prāṇaliṅgāya maṅgalam || 67 ||

bhāvagrāhyāya pūrṇāya bhāvābhāvaikahetave |
kalāsargakṛte tubhyaṃ bhāvaliṅgāya maṅgalam ||
mahānīrājanaṃ dattvā yāñcāṃ kuryādanantaram || 68 ||

yāce'haṃ yāce'haṃ vacasi satataṃ nāmaruciraṃ 
yāce'haṃ yāce'haṃ manasi satataṃ bhāvaracanām |
yāce'haṃ yāce'haṃ śiva tava padāmbojabhaktiṃ 
yāce'haṃ yāce'haṃ punarapi tāmeva satatam || 69 ||

nādhikaṃ muktasaṃprāpyamaśokamacalaṃ sukham |
tvatpadaṃ dehi me śīghraṃ na jāne prārthyamuttamam ||
ityevaṃ yācanāṃ kṛtvā tato vijñaptimācaret | 70 ||

bhṛtyāparādhā namasā śāmyantīti nayena vai |
namasye'to'parādhānme kṣamasva karuṇānidhe ||
iti vijñāpanāṃ kṛtvā nivedyaṃ prokṣayet tataḥ || 71 ||

<p. 107> devasya saviturmadhye yo bhargo no dhiyaḥ kramāt | pracodayāt 
tadvareṇyaṃ śaraṇyaṃ samupāsmahe || 72 ||

iti prokṣya nivedyaṃ tu pariṣiñcet samantataḥ |
pariṣecanakaṃ kṛtvā ṣaḍliṅgārpaṇamācaret || 73 ||

avāṅmānasasaṃvedyānandabodhasudhāmbudhe |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇedamānandākhyaṃ sadāśiva ||
iti nīrājanaṃ datvā tāmbūlaṃ ca samarpayet || 74 ||

guṇatrayakriyādūra guṇatrayasamanvita |
gṛhāṇedaṃ sakarpūraṃ tāmbūlaṃ tāpasārcita ||
iti dattvā ca tāmbūlaṃ nīrājanamathārpayet || 75 ||

ambākarāmbujānītatāmbūlagrahaṇotsuka |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇeśa tāmbūlākhyaṃ sadāśiva ||
iti nīrājanaṃ datvā mantrapuṣpamathārpayet || 76 ||

viṣṇvādivibudhānantapuṣpāñjalisamarcita |
puṣpāñjaliṃ gṛhāṇeśa puṣpāyudhaniṣūdana ||
iti puṣpāñjaliṃ dattvā'saṃkhyaṃ nīrājanaṃ diśet || 77 ||

<p. 108> asaṃkhyeyasahasraśrīrudrarūpāvṛtākhila |
nīrājanaṃ gṛhāṇedamasaṃkhyātaṃ sadāśiva ||
nīrājanamasaṃkhyātaṃ dattvā vastreṇa veṣṭayet || 78 ||

tantunā paṭavannaijarūpeṇāvṛtaviśvaka |
vastreṇa veṣṭayāmīṣṭaliṅgarūpa namo'stu te ||
iti vastreṇa saṃveṣṭya peṭikāyāṃ suvinyaset || 79 ||

sadbhaktahṛdayāvāsa jagadāvāsa śāśvata |
niveśayāmi hṛdaye sukhaṃ vasa satīsakha ||
peṭikāyāmiti nyasyedevamuktaṃ mahārcanam || 80 ||

suvāsinīnāmayamārādhanakramaḥ

pādyādipātrarahitamidaṃ gurvarcanaṃ bhavet |
athāvasarapūjopacārayogāllaghurbhavet ||
suvāsinīnāṃ mukhyo'yaṃ laghrārādhanāvidhiḥ || 81 ||

vidhānamidamarcāyāstāntrikaṃ samudāhṛtam |
sarvamuktaṃ samāsena kimataḥ śrotumicchasi || 82 ||

[iti śrīkāraṇāgame uttarabhāge pārvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
tāntrikapūjāvidhikathanaṃ nāma aṣṭamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 8 ||



<p. 110> [navamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

vidyeśāna mahādeva sarvajñādiguro vibho |
arcāvidhānaśravaṇāt kṛtārthā'smi bhavanmukhāt || 1 ||

śrotukāmā'smi niyamān dīkṣitānāṃ viśeṣataḥ |
brūhi tānakhilānīśa pāhi māṃ karuṇākara || 2 ||

mahādeva uvāca

vakṣyāmi śṛṇu kalyāṇi niyamānakhilānapi |
matpūjātatpareṇāśu matprasādābhikāṅkṣiṇā || 3 ||

dīkṣitānāṃ niyamāḥ

patrāṇyapi prasūnāni vartikāśca japastathā |
saṃkhyā niyamato nityaṃ grahaṇīyā na cānyathā || 4 ||

dīkṣāsaṃskārarahitairjanaiḥ spṛṣṭaṃ jalādikam |
nopayojyaṃ hi kṛtyeṣu madarpaṇamukhādiṣu || 5 ||

nekṣeta pūjāvelāyāṃ dīkṣāsaṃskāravarjitān |
na kupyeccintayedanyān nānyaiḥ saṃllāpamācaret || 6 ||

<p. 111> liṅgamaṅge mukhe bhasma gale rudrākṣameva ca |
mannāma vāci ca tathā na kadāpi viyojayet || 7 ||

vastramābharaṇaṃ puṣpamannapānādyamauṣadham |
na me'samarpya seveta prāṇaiḥ kaṇṭhagatairapi || 8 ||

niveditamathānyasmai na tu mahyaṃ nivedayet |
samarpitaṃ ca liṅgāya na cānyasmai samarpayet || 9 ||

devyuvāca

evaṃ yadi maheśāna kathaṃ strīṇāmidaṃ bhavet |
patnyā hi bharturucchiṣṭaṃ nityaṃ sevyaṃ samīritam ||
na bhojyamasamarpyeti gaditaṃ bhavataiva tu || 10 ||

bhartrā hi svīyaliṅgāya samarpitamidaṃ purā |
kathaṃ punarnivedyaṃ syād bhojyaṃ vāpyasamarpya ca ||
enaṃ me saṃśayaṃ chindhi karuṇāvaruṇālaya || 11 ||

mahādeva uvāca

sādhu pṛṣṭaṃ tvayā devi śṛṇu gopyamidaṃ priye |
nivedane viśeṣo'sti vakṣyāmyavahitā bhava || 12 ||

<p. 112> dvividhaṃ naivedyam

liṅgabhogasvarūpaṃ cānujñārūpamiti dvidhā |
bhartṛśeṣādirūpasya prasādasya gurormama ||
tīrthasya cārpaṇaṃ proktamanujñārūpameva hi || 13 ||

iṣṭāniṣṭaprabhedena dehināṃ karmayogataḥ |
labhyante hyaniśaṃ bhogāsteṣu teṣvapi madvratī || 14 ||

iṣṭe tu bhogarūpaṃ cānujñārūpamaniṣṭake |
nivedanaṃ prakurvīta grāmyadharmādike tathā || 15 ||

devyuvāca

bhartṛśeṣo na yojyaḥ syādyadi bhogārpaṇātmanā |
strīṇāmanudinaṃ bhagnaṃ tādṛśaṃ hi samarpaṇam || 16 ||

yataśca pratyahaṃ sevyo bhartṛśeṣaḥ samīritaḥ |
athavā'pyarcanaṃ kṛtvā kathaṃ kuryānnivedanam || 17 ||

bhartṛśeṣo na yogyo hi cedanyena pativratā |
bhuñjītānyatarat tatra sā kiṃ brūhyathavobhayam || 18 ||

<p. 113> mahādeva uvāca

suvāsinī samarcyāpi bhogarūpanivedanam |
anyenaiva vidhāyānujñāpya tad bhartṛśeṣakam ||
ubhayaṃ caiva bhuñjīta bhaktiyuktā mayi priye || 19 ||

anarpitaṃ yathā'bhojyamatyājyaṃ manniveditam |
matprasādaparityāgī matprasādaṃ sa nārhati || 20 ||

devyuvāca

niveditaṃ cedatyājyaṃ kathamatropapadyate |
dārebhyaścaiva śiṣyebhyaḥ kathaṃ deyaṃ prasādakam || 21 ||

arthibhyo rauravīyebhyaḥ pradeyaṃ vā jalaṃ katham |
gaṇḍūṣakaraśddhyādi kathaṃ samupapadyatām || 22 ||

gaṇḍūṣādau prasādasya tyāgaḥ saṃbhāvyate khalu |
prasādasya pavitratvānmukhaśuddhiḥ kathaṃ bhavet || 23 ||

anarpitena payasā kathaṃ gaṇḍūṣa iṣyate |
samarpitena yadi tat kathaṃ samupapadyate || 24 ||

<p. 114> nivedanaikaviṣayo viśayo bādhate mahān |
etatsarvaṃ samāvedya bhaktānīkaṃ samuddhara || 25 ||

mahādeva uvāca

dārādibhyaḥ prasādasya nārakibhyo jalasya ca |
pradānenārpitatyāgadoṣo naivāsti bhāmini || 26 ||

tyāgasyāvidhimūlasya niṣedhaviṣayatvataḥ |
yathā'vidhikṛtatyāgo na doṣo guṇa eva hi || 27 ||

gaṇḍūṣamukhaśuddhyādikriyārthārpitavāriṇā |
tāstāḥ kriyā hi kartavyāḥ kurvannevaṃ na duṣyati || 28 ||

prasāde'tipavitre'pi mukhaśuddhervidhānataḥ |
tatrāvaśakṛtatyāgo na doṣo vidhimūlakaḥ || 29 ||

kaṇatrayātmanā yo'yaṃ gurvāderupayujyate |
lālāsambandharāhityāttatra śuddhirna hīṣyate || 30 ||

<p. 115> madarcanaparo nityaṃ maddhyānādhīnacetanaḥ |
mannāmacintanodyukto nānyadevādikaṃ smaret || 31 ||

devyuvāca

varṇāśramaikaniṣṭhānāṃ nityanaimittikādiṣu |
agnyādiparicaryāśca prāpyante'harahaḥ kila ||
tvadekaniṣṭhāparamaiḥ kartavyāstāḥ kathaṃ prabho || 32 ||

mahādeva uvāca 

rājaikasevakasyāpi tadājñāvaśataḥ priye |
tanmantryādeśca kaiṅkaryaṃ bhṛtyasya nahi duṣyati || 33 ||

manniṣṭhānāmapi tathā madājñāśruticodanāt |
nityanaimittike cānyadevasevā na duṣyati || 34 ||

madarpaṇārtharacitapākaśeṣaṃ prayatnataḥ |
na prayacchedabhaktebhyo vijātīyebhya eva ca || 35 ||

<p. 116> yaḥ svayaṃ bhuktiyukto'pi śaivaṃ vāṅmātrato janam |
adhamaṃ manyate tasya bhaktirvyarthā maheśvari || 36 ||

tasmād bhaktiyuto martyo nyūnamanyūnameva vā |
adhamaṃ vā'pi rudrākṣabhasmaliṅgavibhūṣaṇam ||
uttamottamarūpeṇa paśyet sarvamasaṃśayam || 37 ||

devyuvāca

varṇāśramaikasaktānāṃ kathamatropapadyate |
vipreṇa hyanyajātīyo bhāvyaḥ syāduttamatvataḥ ||
bhāvite varṇamaryādā na kathaṃ vyāhatā bhavet || 38 ||

mahādeva uvāca

vipro vijātibhaktāṃstu manasaiva hi pūjayet |
anyathā vartamāno hi labhate varṇavicyutim || 39 ||

adhogatinivṛttiṃ hi varṇadharmo niyacchati |
samagrā susthirā śuddhā bhaktirmuktiṃ prayacchati || 40 ||

varṇāśramayutānāṃ hi bhaktilopo bhavedyadi |
adhaḥ padopalabdhiḥ syādantye sarvāṅgasundari || 41 ||

ataḥ sarvāṅgasampūrṇabhaktiyuktātmanāṃ priye |
varṇāśramīyadharmāṇāṃ nirbandhaḥ saphalaḥ smṛtaḥ || 42 ||

[iti śrīkāraṇāgame uttarabhāge pārvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
niyamopadeśo nāma navamaḥ paṭalaḥ] || 9 ||



<p. 118> [daśamaḥ paṭalaḥ]

devyuvāca

śāmbhavānāṃ hi śuddhānāṃ satataṃ liṅgadhāriṇām |
samprāpte'śucisaṃsarge lokasaṃsargasambhave ||
nānāvidhe kathaṃ nu syāt prāyaścittaṃ vadasva me || 1 ||

mahādeva uvāca

sādhu pṛṣṭaṃ mahādevi tvayā lokahitecchayā |
prāyaścittavidhiṃ vakṣye sadā liṅgāṅgasaṅginām || 2 ||

liṅgaṃ hi sarvadā śuddhamaśuddhaṃ sarvadā vapuḥ |
ataḥ ṣaḍadhvasaṃśuddhiyogācchuddhaṃ vidhāya tat || 3 ||

pratiṣṭhitaṃ liṅgamatra tataḥ śārīradoṣataḥ |
na liṅgamapavitraṃ syāt sarvāvasthāsu bhāmini || 4 ||

dīkṣāsaṃskārarahitairapavitraśarīrakaiḥ |
na saṃspṛśyaṃ hi malliṅgamiti nirṇītamadrije || 5 ||

<p. 119> pratiṣṭhāyāṃ dīkṣitasyaivādhikāraḥ

adīkṣito nādhikārī pratiṣṭhāyāṃ mama priye |
dīkṣitaireva kartavyaṃ pratiṣṭheti pratiśrutam ||
anyathā rāṣṭranāśaḥ syāt tasmādanyairna kārayet || 6 ||

parārthapūjādhikṛto yadyapi syācchivadvijaḥ |
tathāpi tasya kānīnatayā bbrāhmaṇyalopataḥ || 7 ||

ācāryatvānadhikṛteḥ pratiṣṭhāyāṃ sa nārhati |
dīkṣāsaṃskārayuktaścet pūjāyāṃ sthāvareṣu saḥ ||
svaparārthopayuktāyāmadhikuryānna saṃśayaḥ || 8 ||

dīkṣāsaṃskārasaṃpannastasmālliṅgāṅgasaṅgavān |
lokārādhyatvayogena pratiṣṭhādhikṛto bhavet || 9 ||

śaivadīkṣāpavitrāṅgāḥ sarvāvasthāsvapi priye |
spṛśanto naiva duṣyanti mama liṅgaṃ suśobhanam || 10 ||

adīkṣitaḥ spṛśan liṅgaṃ doṣī bhavati niścitam |
adīkṣitaistu spṛṣṭaṃ celliṅgaṃ saṃskāryameva hi || 11 ||

<p. 120> devyuvāca

niśi nidrāvinighnasya luṭhataḥ paripārśvayoḥ |
liṅgasyādhasthitirbhāvyā kathaṃ doṣaḥ praśāmyati || 12 ||

mahādeva uvāca

karapādādisaṃsparśahtordoṣasya subhruvaḥ |
nānyā viniṣkṛtiḥ śastā prātaḥ patyuḥ padānateḥ || 13 ||

tathoṣasi prabodhāptau malliṅgapraṇatiḥ parā |
sarvadoṣapraśamanī netrasaṃsparśarūpiṇī || 14 ||

devyuvāca

liṅgasya dhartuḥ śārīradoṣāsparśe'pi nityaśaḥ |
adīkṣitaiśca saṃsparśo loke saṃbhāvyate khalu || 15 ||

vapanādiṣvavaśato nāpitasparśa iṣyate |
hīnavarṇairapi tathā caṇḍālaiḥ śvapacairapi || 16 ||

liṅginaḥ sparśasaṃprāptau kīdṛśī niṣkṛtirbhavet |
etatsarvaṃ samācakṣva lokānugrahatatpara || 17 ||

<p. 121> mahādeva uvāca

vapanādau na liṅgasya muṇḍisparśo yathā bhavet |
tathā prayatitavyaṃ khalvanyathā niṣkṛtiḥ parā || 18 ||

liṅgino nāpitasparśe śivasūtraṃ visṛjya ca |
punarnavaṃ dhāryameva brahmasūtraṃ tathaiva ca ||
pañcākṣarīṃ ca gāyatrīmaṣṭottaraśataṃ japet || 19 ||

liṅgasya nāpitasparśe pavamānādisūktakaiḥ |
śrīrudreṇa ca kartavyaṃ prokṣaṇaṃ suviśeṣataḥ || 20 ||

caṇḍālādijanasparśe sūtrayugmamapāsya ca |
pavamānādibhiḥ prokṣya cāṣṭottarasahasrakam ||
gāyatrīṃ mūlamantraṃ ca japtvā naktāśano bhavet || 21 ||

adīkṣitaiḥ savarṇaiścāsavarṇaiścāpi saṃgatau |
mūlamaṣṭottaraśataṃ japet taddoṣaśāntaye || 22 ||

devyuvāca

niṣkṛtiḥ kīdṛśī proktā kālabhaṅge'rcanasya tu |
āpatsu pūjālope ca tathā lope japasya ca ||
alābhe patrapuṣpāṇāṃ niyatānāṃ ca saṃkhyayā || 23 ||

<p. 122> mahādeva uvāca

mūlamaṣṭottaraśataṃ kālabhaṅge'rcanasya tu |
pūjāyāśca japasyāpi lope mūlaṃ sahasrakam || 24 ||

alābhe patrapuṣpāṇāṃ niyatānāṃ sulocane |
ekaikasya japedeva mūlamaṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 25 ||

devyuvāca

karāt pramādavaśataścyutaṃ liṅgamadhaḥ patet |
tadā vai kiṃ nu karttavyaṃ prāyaścittaṃ vadasva me || 26 ||

mahādeva uvāca

pramādena yadā liṅgaṃ nijahastādadhaḥ patet |
gṛhītvā tattadā japyaṃ mūlamaṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 27 ||

anuktānāṃ ca doṣāṇāṃ nityaṃ saṃbhāvitātmanām |
prāyaścittatayā japyaṃ mūlamaṣṭottaraṃ śatam || 28 ||

devyuvāca

gurudattasya liṅgasya bhaṅgo lopo'thavā bhavet |
kiṃ nu kāryaṃ tadā deva kṛpayā tannibodha me || 29 ||

<p. 123> mahādeva uvāca

hanta te kathayāmīdaṃ rahasyamapi suvrate |
dvitrikhaṇḍatayā bhaṅge badhvā sarjarasena tu ||
kṛtvā tattvakalānyāsaṃ pūjayedaviśeṣataḥ || 30 ||

cūrṇībhāve tu liṅgasya cānyasmin tadgatāḥ kalāḥ |
āropya bibhṛyālliṅgaṃ punarlabdhaṃ guroḥ karāt || 31 ||

atha liṅgasya lope tu kartavyaṃ śṛṇu sundari |
liṅgasyādarśane tyājyāḥ prāṇāḥ syurbhaktiyogataḥ || 32 ||

prāṇatyāgo tvaśaktaścedekaviṃśaddināvadhi |
nirāhāro japanmūlaṃ liṅgamanveṣayejjanaiḥ || 33 ||

yadā vai labhate liṅgaṃ dhṛtvā bhaktyā tadaiva tat |
guruṃ māheśvarāṃcaiva yathāśakti samarcayet || 34 ||

tadāpyalābhe visṛjedasūn sadbhaktiyogataḥ |
prāṇatyāge tvaśaktaścelliṅgamanyad guroḥ karāt || 35 ||


<p. 124> ākṛṣṭapūrvaliṅgīyakalānyāsābhiśobhitam |
ṣaḍadhvanyāsakalitaṃ bibhṛyādapramādataḥ || 36 ||

devyuvāca

devadeva mahādeva dhṛte liṅge nave tataḥ |
labhet cet pūrvaliṅgam kartavyaṃ kiṃ vadasva me || 37 ||

mahādeva uvāca

pūrvaliṅgopalambhe'pi tyajennaiva dhṛtaṃ navam |
yattadīyakalāḥ sarvā nave saṃveśitāḥ purā ||
tatpūrvaliṅgaṃ gurave vinivedya kṣipejjale || 38 ||

devyuvāca

naṣṭaliṅgastyajet prāṇān yadi dehaṃ tadīyakam |
tatkathaṃ brūhi saṃskāryamanarhaṃ liṅgavarjitam || 39 ||

yadi dhāryaṃ liṅgamanyat prāṇatyāgo nirarthakaḥ |
cedadhāryamasaṃskāryaṃ gātraṃ tasya bhavet tadā || 40 ||

doṣastūbhayathā dṛṣṭo naṣṭaliṅgasya dehinaḥ |
enaṃ me saṃśayaṃ chindhi karuṇāvaruṇālaya || 41 ||

<p. 125> mahādeva uvāca

tyaktāsornaṣṭaliṅgasya tatkṣaṇe mokṣasaṃgatiḥ |
nānarthastadasutyāgaḥ saṃskārastu yathā śṛṇu || 42 ||

ākṛṣṭanaṣṭaliṅgīyakalānyāsayutaṃ navam |
liṅgamanyat susaṃyojya saṃskuryād vidhinā tanum || 43 ||

saṃskārārthaṃ punarliṅge yojite'pi śarīrake |
tyaktāsornaiva lopo'sti yadayaṃ mokṣamāptavān |
talliṅgaṃ prāṇavad dhāryamapramādena sarvadā || 44 ||

sarvaṃ te kathitaṃ devi rahasyamapi suvrate |
aputrāyāpyaśiṣyāya na prakāśyamidaṃ tvayā || 45 ||

[iti śrīkāraṇāgame uttarabhāge pārvatīparameśvarasaṃvāde kriyāpāde 
prāyaścittavidhikathanaṃ nāma daśamaḥ paṭalaḥ]] || 10 

